window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":7,"en":"Robotics & Automation in Work and Sport","zh":"機器人與自動化","items":[{"w":"humanoid","pos":"n.","def":"a robot that looks and moves like a person","cn":"人形機器人","s":"The museum displayed a friendly ________ that could walk and wave, so many children lined up to shake its hand.","zh":"博物館展示了一個友善的人形機器人,它會走路和揮手,所以許多孩子排隊和它握手。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A1","t":"人形機器人"},{"w":"android","pos":"n.","def":"a robot made to look very much like a human","cn":"仿生人;擬真機器人","s":"In the film, the ________ looked so much like a real woman that nobody noticed, but her eyes sometimes glowed blue.","zh":"在電影中,那個仿生人看起來非常像真正的女人,沒有人察覺,但她的眼睛有時會發出藍光。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A2","t":"仿生人"},{"w":"cyborg","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose body has machine parts added","cn":"半機械人;生化人","s":"My brother loves science fiction stories about a ________ with a metal arm, and he dreams of building one someday.","zh":"我哥哥很喜歡關於一個裝著金屬手臂的半機械人的科幻故事,而且他夢想有一天能自己造一個。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A3","t":"半機械人"},{"w":"manipulator","pos":"n.","def":"a robot arm that picks up and moves objects","cn":"機械手臂;操作臂","s":"The factory installed a new ________ that lifts heavy car doors, so workers no longer hurt their backs on the job.","zh":"工廠安裝了一支新的機械手臂來舉起沉重的車門,所以工人在工作時不再傷到背部。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A4","t":"機械手臂"},{"w":"gripper","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a robot that holds things","cn":"夾爪;抓取器","s":"The soft rubber ________ can pick up an egg without breaking it, and engineers are proud of this delicate design.","zh":"這個柔軟的橡膠夾爪能拿起一顆蛋而不弄破,工程師們對這個精巧的設計感到自豪。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A5","t":"夾爪"},{"w":"joint","pos":"n.","def":"a place where two parts connect and can bend","cn":"關節;接頭","s":"Each finger of the robot hand has three ________, so it can bend and hold a pen almost like a human hand.","zh":"這隻機器手的每根手指都有三個關節,所以它能彎曲並幾乎像人手一樣握筆。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A6","t":"關節"},{"w":"actuator","pos":"n.","def":"a part that makes a machine move","cn":"致動器;驅動器","s":"When the ________ in the robot's knee stopped working, the robot could not climb the stairs, so the team replaced it.","zh":"當機器人膝蓋裡的致動器停止運作時,它就無法爬樓梯,所以團隊更換了它。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A7","t":"致動器"},{"w":"gear","pos":"n.","def":"a wheel with teeth that turns other wheels","cn":"齒輪","s":"The old clock has many tiny ________ inside, and they must turn together perfectly or the time will be wrong.","zh":"這座老時鐘裡面有許多小齒輪,它們必須完美地一起轉動,否則時間就會不準。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A8","t":"齒輪"},{"w":"lever","pos":"n.","def":"a bar you push or pull to control a machine","cn":"操縱桿;槓桿","s":"The driver pulled the ________ to raise the robot's arm, but it moved too fast and almost hit the ceiling.","zh":"駕駛員拉動操縱桿來升起機器人的手臂,但它移動得太快,差點撞到天花板。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A9","t":"操縱桿"},{"w":"hinge","pos":"n.","def":"a metal part that lets a door or lid swing","cn":"鉸鏈","s":"The robot's head moves on a strong ________, so it can nod and look down at people who talk to it.","zh":"機器人的頭靠一個堅固的鉸鏈轉動,所以它能點頭並低頭看著和它說話的人。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A10","t":"鉸鏈"},{"w":"axle","pos":"n.","def":"a rod that connects and turns two wheels","cn":"車軸;輪軸","s":"The delivery robot stopped in the middle of the road because its front ________ broke, and a technician had to fix it.","zh":"送貨機器人停在路中間,因為它的前車軸斷了,技術人員必須去修理它。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A11","t":"車軸"},{"w":"pulley","pos":"n.","def":"a wheel with a rope used to lift things","cn":"滑輪","s":"Builders used a ________ to lift the heavy robot onto the stage, and the audience clapped when it arrived safely.","zh":"工人用滑輪把沉重的機器人吊上舞台,當它安全抵達時觀眾都鼓掌了。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A12","t":"滑輪"},{"w":"hydraulic","pos":"adj.","def":"moved by liquid that is pushed through pipes","cn":"液壓的","s":"The digger uses a ________ arm to lift tons of soil, so one machine can do the work of twenty people.","zh":"這台挖土機使用液壓手臂來舉起好幾噸的土,所以一台機器就能做二十個人的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A13","t":"液壓"},{"w":"pneumatic","pos":"adj.","def":"powered by air that is pushed under pressure","cn":"氣動的","s":"The robot hand has ________ muscles that fill with air, and this lets it hold soft fruit gently.","zh":"這隻機器手有充氣的氣動肌肉,這讓它能輕柔地握住柔軟的水果。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A14","t":"氣動"},{"w":"wiring","pos":"n.","def":"the system of wires inside a machine","cn":"線路;配線","s":"After the flood, the ________ inside the robot was wet and damaged, so the engineers had to replace every cable.","zh":"水災過後,機器人內部的線路又濕又受損,所以工程師必須更換每一條電線。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A15","t":"線路"},{"w":"cable","pos":"n.","def":"a thick wire that carries electricity or signals","cn":"電纜;纜線","s":"Please do not step on the black ________ on the floor, because it sends power to the robot on the stage.","zh":"請不要踩到地上那條黑色的電纜,因為它正把電力傳送給舞台上的機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A16","t":"電纜"},{"w":"microcontroller","pos":"n.","def":"a very small computer that controls a device","cn":"微控制器","s":"Our class programmed a cheap ________ to switch on a fan, and everyone cheered when the fan started spinning.","zh":"我們班替一個便宜的微控制器寫程式來打開電風扇,當風扇開始轉動時大家都歡呼了。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A17","t":"微控制器"},{"w":"lens","pos":"n.","def":"curved glass that helps a camera see clearly","cn":"鏡頭;透鏡","s":"The robot could not recognise faces because its camera ________ was dirty, so I cleaned it with a soft cloth.","zh":"機器人無法辨認臉孔,因為它的攝影機鏡頭髒了,所以我用軟布把它擦乾淨。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A18","t":"鏡頭"},{"w":"lidar","pos":"n.","def":"a system that measures distance using laser light","cn":"光達;雷射雷達","s":"Self-driving cars use ________ to measure how far away other cars are, and this helps them avoid accidents in traffic.","zh":"自動駕駛汽車使用光達來測量其他車輛有多遠,這幫助它們在車流中避免事故。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A19","t":"光達"},{"w":"infrared","pos":"adj.","def":"using light that people cannot see but feel as heat","cn":"紅外線的","s":"The security robot has an ________ camera, so it can see people in the dark when the lights are off.","zh":"這台保全機器人有一台紅外線攝影機,所以在燈關掉時它也能在黑暗中看見人。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A20","t":"紅外線"},{"w":"torque","pos":"n.","def":"the turning force of an engine or motor","cn":"扭力;轉矩","s":"This electric motor produces a lot of ________, so the small robot can push a heavy box across the floor.","zh":"這個電動馬達產生很大的扭力,所以這台小機器人能把一個沉重的箱子推過地板。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A21","t":"扭力"},{"w":"lightweight","pos":"adj.","def":"not heavy; easy to carry","cn":"輕量的;重量輕的","s":"The new delivery drone is made from ________ plastic, so it uses less battery and can fly much farther.","zh":"新的送貨無人機是用輕量塑膠製成的,所以它耗電較少並且能飛得更遠。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A22","t":"輕量"},{"w":"alloy","pos":"n.","def":"a metal made by mixing two or more metals","cn":"合金","s":"The robot's body is made of a strong ________, so it does not break when it falls down during tests.","zh":"這台機器人的機身是用堅固的合金製成的,所以它在測試中跌倒時不會損壞。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A23","t":"合金"},{"w":"titanium","pos":"n.","def":"a strong, light, silver-coloured metal","cn":"鈦","s":"Engineers chose ________ for the robot's legs because it is strong but light, although it is quite expensive.","zh":"工程師為機器人的腿選擇了鈦,因為它堅固又輕,雖然它相當昂貴。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A24","t":"鈦"},{"w":"rechargeable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be filled with electricity again","cn":"可充電的","s":"The toy robot runs on ________ batteries, so we just plug it in at night instead of buying new ones.","zh":"這個玩具機器人使用可充電的電池,所以我們晚上只要插上電,而不用買新電池。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A25","t":"可充電的"},{"w":"exoskeleton","pos":"n.","def":"a wearable frame that gives the body extra strength","cn":"外骨骼","s":"The nurse wears a light ________ when she lifts patients, so her back no longer hurts at the end of the day.","zh":"這位護理師在抬病人時會穿上輕型外骨骼,所以她一天結束時背部不再疼痛。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A26","t":"外骨骼"},{"w":"limb","pos":"n.","def":"an arm or a leg","cn":"肢體;四肢","s":"The robot dog lost one ________ in the fall, but it could still walk slowly on its other three legs.","zh":"那隻機器狗在跌倒時失去了一條腿,但它仍然能用另外三條腿慢慢走路。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A27","t":"腿"},{"w":"payload","pos":"n.","def":"the load that a vehicle or drone carries","cn":"酬載;載重","s":"The drone can carry a ________ of five kilograms, so farmers use it to spread seeds over their fields.","zh":"這架無人機能攜帶五公斤的載重,所以農夫用它在田地上撒種子。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A28","t":"載重"},{"w":"blueprint","pos":"n.","def":"a detailed plan or drawing for building something","cn":"藍圖;設計圖","s":"The students studied the ________ of the robot carefully, and then they built every part exactly as shown.","zh":"學生們仔細研究了機器人的設計圖,然後他們完全照著圖示製作每一個零件。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A29","t":"設計圖"},{"w":"dismantle","pos":"v.","def":"to take a machine apart into pieces","cn":"拆解;拆卸","s":"We had to ________ the broken robot to find the problem, but putting it back together took the whole afternoon.","zh":"我們必須拆解這台壞掉的機器人來找出問題,但把它重新組裝回去花了整個下午。","part":"A","sec":"Robot Design & Parts 機器人設計與零件","lab":"A30","t":"拆解"},{"w":"assembly line","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a row of workers or machines that build products step by step","cn":"裝配線;生產線","s":"Robots now do most of the welding on the car ________ ________, while people check the finished cars for problems.","zh":"機器人現在負責汽車裝配線上大部分的焊接工作,而人們則檢查完成的汽車是否有問題。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A31","t":"裝配線"},{"w":"conveyor belt","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a moving belt that carries things from place to place","cn":"輸送帶","s":"Boxes move along the ________ ________ all day, and a robot arm picks out any box with the wrong label.","zh":"箱子整天沿著輸送帶移動,而一支機器手臂會挑出任何貼錯標籤的箱子。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A32","t":"輸送帶"},{"w":"plant","pos":"n.","def":"a large factory where things are made","cn":"工廠;廠房","s":"The new battery ________ near the city uses hundreds of robots, but it still employs about two thousand workers.","zh":"城市附近的新電池工廠使用了數百台機器人,但它仍然僱用了大約兩千名員工。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A33","t":"工廠"},{"w":"mass production","pos":"n.phr.","def":"making very large numbers of the same product","cn":"大量生產","s":"________ ________ made cars cheaper in the twentieth century, and robots are making many products cheaper today.","zh":"大量生產在二十世紀讓汽車變得更便宜,而機器人如今正讓許多產品變得更便宜。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A34","t":"大量生產"},{"w":"industrial","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with factories and making goods","cn":"工業的","s":"Most ________ robots work behind safety fences, because their heavy arms move very fast and could injure people.","zh":"大多數工業機器人在安全圍欄後面工作,因為它們沉重的手臂移動得很快,可能會傷到人。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A35","t":"工業"},{"w":"forklift","pos":"n.","def":"a small vehicle with two metal arms for lifting goods","cn":"堆高機","s":"The driverless ________ carries boxes around the warehouse at night, so the shelves are full when staff arrive.","zh":"這台無人駕駛的堆高機夜間在倉庫裡搬運箱子,所以員工到達時貨架已經補滿了。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A36","t":"堆高機"},{"w":"pallet","pos":"n.","def":"a flat wooden frame that goods are stacked on","cn":"棧板;貨板","s":"The robot lifts each ________ of bottled water onto the truck, and it never drops a single bottle.","zh":"機器人把每一個裝著瓶裝水的棧板抬上卡車,而且它從不掉落任何一瓶。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A37","t":"棧板"},{"w":"logistics","pos":"n.","def":"organising how goods are stored and moved","cn":"物流","s":"My cousin works in ________ for an online shop, and she says robots now pack most of the orders.","zh":"我表姊在一家網路商店從事物流工作,她說現在大部分的訂單都是由機器人包裝的。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A38","t":"物流"},{"w":"supply chain","pos":"n.phr.","def":"all the steps from making a product to selling it","cn":"供應鏈","s":"When the chip factory closed, the whole ________ ________ slowed down, so many shops had no new phones to sell.","zh":"當晶片工廠關閉時,整個供應鏈都變慢了,所以許多商店沒有新手機可以賣。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A39","t":"供應鏈"},{"w":"parcel","pos":"n.","def":"a package sent by post or delivery","cn":"包裹","s":"A small robot brought the ________ to my door, and I picked it up after typing a code on its lid.","zh":"一台小機器人把包裹送到我家門口,我在它的蓋子上輸入密碼後才拿到它。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A40","t":"包裹"},{"w":"dispatch","pos":"v.","def":"to send something or someone somewhere","cn":"派送;發送","s":"The system can ________ a delivery robot within minutes, so customers often receive their lunch while it is still hot.","zh":"這個系統能在幾分鐘內派出一台送貨機器人,所以顧客常常在午餐還熱的時候就收到。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A41","t":"派出"},{"w":"courier","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that delivers packages","cn":"快遞員;快遞公司","s":"The ________ usually delivers our parcels by motorbike, but last week a drone dropped one in our garden.","zh":"快遞員通常騎機車送我們的包裹,但上星期一架無人機把一個包裹丟在我們的花園裡。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A42","t":"快遞員"},{"w":"loading dock","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the place where trucks are filled or emptied","cn":"裝卸區;卸貨平台","s":"Robots carry the boxes to the ________ ________, and then the drivers check them before the trucks leave.","zh":"機器人把箱子搬到裝卸區,然後司機在卡車出發前檢查它們。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A43","t":"裝卸區"},{"w":"shelving","pos":"n.","def":"a set of shelves for storing things","cn":"貨架;架子","s":"The warehouse has tall metal ________, and small robots climb up it to bring down the boxes people order.","zh":"倉庫裡有高大的金屬貨架,小機器人會爬上去把人們訂購的箱子拿下來。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A44","t":"貨架"},{"w":"barcode","pos":"n.","def":"a pattern of lines that a machine can read","cn":"條碼","s":"Each box has a ________ on its side, so the robot knows exactly where to take it in the building.","zh":"每個箱子側面都有一個條碼,所以機器人確切知道要把它送到大樓的哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A45","t":"條碼"},{"w":"scanner","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that reads codes or makes pictures of things","cn":"掃描器","s":"The ________ at the gate reads every package, and it beeps loudly if a box goes to the wrong area.","zh":"門口的掃描器會讀取每個包裹,如果有箱子送錯區域,它就會大聲嗶嗶叫。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A46","t":"掃描器"},{"w":"throughput","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of work done in a period of time","cn":"產能;處理量","s":"After the robots arrived, the factory's ________ doubled, but the managers still needed people to solve problems.","zh":"機器人到來之後,工廠的產能翻倍了,但經理們仍然需要人來解決問題。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A47","t":"產能"},{"w":"weld","pos":"v.","def":"to join metal parts by melting them together","cn":"焊接","s":"Robots can ________ car parts faster than people, and they do not need to breathe the dangerous smoke.","zh":"機器人能比人更快地焊接汽車零件,而且它們不需要吸入危險的煙霧。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A48","t":"焊接"},{"w":"welder","pos":"n.","def":"a person or machine that joins metal by heating it","cn":"焊接工;焊接機","s":"My uncle was a ________ for twenty years, but now he trains young workers to use robot welding machines.","zh":"我叔叔當了二十年的焊工,但現在他訓練年輕工人使用焊接機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A49","t":"焊工"},{"w":"quality control","pos":"n.phr.","def":"checking that products are made correctly","cn":"品質管制;品管","s":"Cameras now help with ________ ________, because they can spot tiny scratches that tired workers might miss.","zh":"攝影機現在協助品質管制,因為它們能發現疲倦的工人可能漏看的細小刮痕。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A50","t":"品質管制"},{"w":"defect","pos":"n.","def":"a fault or mistake in something that was made","cn":"瑕疵;缺陷","s":"The camera found a small ________ in the phone screen, so the robot removed it from the line immediately.","zh":"攝影機在手機螢幕上發現一個小瑕疵,所以機器人立刻把它從生產線上移除。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A51","t":"瑕疵"},{"w":"defective","pos":"adj.","def":"not made correctly; not working properly","cn":"有瑕疵的;故障的","s":"The company called back thousands of ________ toys, because a loose part could hurt young children.","zh":"公司召回了數千個有瑕疵的玩具,因為一個鬆脫的零件可能會傷到幼童。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A52","t":"有瑕疵的"},{"w":"maintenance","pos":"n.","def":"the work of keeping machines in good condition","cn":"維修;保養","s":"Robots do not get tired, but they need regular ________, so the factory stops them every Sunday for checks.","zh":"機器人不會累,但它們需要定期保養,所以工廠每個星期天讓它們停機檢查。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A53","t":"保養"},{"w":"repetitive","pos":"adj.","def":"doing the same thing again and again","cn":"重複的","s":"Robots are good at ________ jobs like packing boxes, so workers can spend more time on creative tasks.","zh":"機器人擅長像包裝箱子這樣重複的工作,所以工人能花更多時間在有創意的任務上。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A54","t":"重複的"},{"w":"heavy lifting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the work of picking up and moving heavy things","cn":"搬運重物;粗重工作","s":"The robots do the ________ ________ in the warehouse, while staff focus on checking orders and helping customers.","zh":"機器人在倉庫裡負責搬運重物,而員工則專注於檢查訂單和協助顧客。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A55","t":"搬運重物"},{"w":"operator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who controls a machine","cn":"操作員","s":"The crane ________ watched the screen carefully, because one small mistake could drop the steel on the workers below.","zh":"起重機操作員仔細地看著螢幕,因為一個小錯誤就可能把鋼材掉到下面的工人身上。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A56","t":"操作員"},{"w":"machinery","pos":"n.","def":"machines in general, especially large ones","cn":"機械;機器(總稱)","s":"Farmers in our village bought new ________ last year, so they can harvest rice with far fewer helpers.","zh":"我們村子的農夫去年買了新機械,所以他們能用少得多的人手收割稻米。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A57","t":"機械"},{"w":"cobot","pos":"n.","def":"a robot designed to work safely next to people","cn":"協作機器人","s":"The ________ works right beside the staff, and it stops at once if someone's hand comes too close.","zh":"這台協作機器人就在員工旁邊工作,如果有人的手靠得太近,它會立刻停下來。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A58","t":"協作機器人"},{"w":"workstation","pos":"n.","def":"the place where a worker or machine does a job","cn":"工作站;工作台","s":"Each ________ on the line has one person and one robot, and they pass parts to each other all day.","zh":"生產線上的每個工作站都有一個人和一台機器人,他們整天互相傳遞零件。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A59","t":"工作站"},{"w":"crane","pos":"n.","def":"a tall machine for lifting very heavy objects","cn":"起重機;吊車","s":"A huge ________ lifted the containers off the ship, and it was controlled by a person in an office far away.","zh":"一台巨大的起重機把貨櫃從船上吊起來,而它是由遠處辦公室裡的一個人控制的。","part":"A","sec":"Robots at Work: Factories & Logistics 工廠與物流中的機器人","lab":"A60","t":"起重機"},{"w":"robot vacuum","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small machine that cleans floors by itself","cn":"掃地機器人","s":"Our ________ ________ cleans the living room while we are at work, but it often gets stuck under the sofa.","zh":"我們的掃地機器人在我們上班時打掃客廳,但它常常卡在沙發底下。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A61","t":"掃地機器人"},{"w":"lawnmower","pos":"n.","def":"a machine for cutting grass","cn":"割草機","s":"My neighbour bought a robot ________ that cuts the grass every morning, so his garden always looks tidy.","zh":"我的鄰居買了一台機器人割草機,每天早上割草,所以他的花園總是看起來很整齊。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A62","t":"割草機"},{"w":"dishwasher","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that washes plates and cups","cn":"洗碗機","s":"We load the ________ after dinner, and the clean plates are ready before we go to bed.","zh":"我們晚餐後把碗盤放進洗碗機,睡覺前乾淨的盤子就準備好了。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A63","t":"洗碗機"},{"w":"appliance","pos":"n.","def":"a machine used in the home, like a fridge","cn":"家電;家用電器","s":"Many new kitchen ________ can connect to the internet, so you can start the rice cooker from your phone.","zh":"許多新的廚房家電可以連上網路,所以你可以用手機啟動電鍋。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A64","t":"家電"},{"w":"smart home","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a house where devices are controlled by the internet","cn":"智慧家庭;智慧住宅","s":"In our ________ ________, the lights turn on when we walk in, and the heater starts before we wake up.","zh":"在我們的智慧家庭裡,我們一走進去燈就會亮,而暖氣在我們起床前就開始運作。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A65","t":"智慧家庭"},{"w":"voice command","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a spoken order that a machine follows","cn":"語音指令","s":"Grandpa uses a ________ ________ to turn on the TV, because the small buttons on the remote are hard to see.","zh":"爺爺用語音指令打開電視,因為遙控器上的小按鈕很難看清楚。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A66","t":"語音指令"},{"w":"vending machine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a machine that sells drinks or snacks","cn":"自動販賣機","s":"The ________ ________ at the station takes phone payments, so I bought a drink without any coins.","zh":"車站的自動販賣機接受手機付款,所以我沒用任何硬幣就買了一杯飲料。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A67","t":"自動販賣機"},{"w":"self-checkout","pos":"n.","def":"a machine where shoppers pay without a cashier","cn":"自助結帳機","s":"The supermarket added six ________ machines, but older customers still prefer to queue for a person.","zh":"超市增加了六台自助結帳機,但年長的顧客仍然比較喜歡排隊找人結帳。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A68","t":"自助結帳"},{"w":"kiosk","pos":"n.","def":"a small screen or booth where you order or buy things","cn":"自助點餐機;服務亭","s":"I ordered my burger at the touchscreen ________, and a robot brought it to my table ten minutes later.","zh":"我在觸控自助點餐機點了漢堡,十分鐘後一台機器人把它送到我的桌上。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A69","t":"自助點餐機"},{"w":"cashier","pos":"n.","def":"a person who takes money in a shop","cn":"收銀員","s":"The friendly ________ at the corner shop knows all the customers, so people still visit even though machines are faster.","zh":"街角商店那位友善的收銀員認識所有顧客,所以即使機器比較快,人們仍然會去光顧。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A70","t":"收銀員"},{"w":"receptionist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who greets visitors at a front desk","cn":"接待員;櫃台人員","s":"The hotel replaced its night ________ with a talking robot, but guests complained that it could not answer simple questions.","zh":"飯店用一台會說話的機器人取代了夜班接待員,但客人抱怨它無法回答簡單的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A71","t":"接待員"},{"w":"waiter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who serves food in a restaurant","cn":"服務生","s":"The restaurant uses a robot ________ to carry dishes, while the staff spend more time chatting with customers.","zh":"這家餐廳使用機器人服務生送菜,而員工則花更多時間和顧客聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A72","t":"服務生"},{"w":"chore","pos":"n.","def":"a small, regular job in the house","cn":"家事;雜務","s":"Washing clothes used to be a hard ________, but now machines do most of the work for us.","zh":"洗衣服以前是一件辛苦的家事,但現在機器幫我們做了大部分的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A73","t":"家事"},{"w":"errand","pos":"n.","def":"a short trip to buy or deliver something","cn":"跑腿;差事","s":"My mother asked a delivery robot to do a quick ________, so it brought medicine from the pharmacy next door.","zh":"我媽媽請一台送貨機器人去跑腿,於是它從隔壁藥局送來了藥。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A74","t":"跑腿"},{"w":"mop","pos":"v.","def":"to clean a floor with a wet cloth on a stick","cn":"拖(地)","s":"This robot can vacuum and ________ the floor at the same time, so our kitchen stays clean every day.","zh":"這台機器人能同時吸塵和拖地,所以我們的廚房每天都保持乾淨。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A75","t":"拖"},{"w":"hospitality","pos":"n.","def":"the business of hotels, restaurants and serving guests","cn":"餐旅業;款待","s":"Robots are becoming common in the ________ industry, but many travellers still want a warm smile from a real person.","zh":"機器人在餐旅業越來越常見,但許多旅客仍然希望得到真人溫暖的微笑。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A76","t":"餐旅"},{"w":"greet","pos":"v.","def":"to say hello to someone when they arrive","cn":"迎接;打招呼","s":"A small robot at the bank door will ________ you by name, and then it tells you which counter to visit.","zh":"銀行門口的小機器人會叫著你的名字跟你打招呼,然後告訴你要去哪個櫃台。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A77","t":"跟你打招呼"},{"w":"social robot","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a robot designed to talk and interact with people","cn":"社交機器人","s":"The ________ ________ in the care home tells jokes and plays games, so the residents feel less bored in the afternoon.","zh":"安養院裡的社交機器人會講笑話和玩遊戲,所以住民下午比較不會無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A78","t":"社交機器人"},{"w":"surgical","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with medical operations","cn":"外科的;手術的","s":"The hospital bought a ________ robot that can make very small cuts, so patients recover faster after their operations.","zh":"醫院買了一台能做出非常小切口的手術機器人,所以病人手術後恢復得更快。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A79","t":"手術"},{"w":"surgeon","pos":"n.","def":"a doctor who performs operations","cn":"外科醫生","s":"The ________ controlled the robot from a screen beside the bed, and the operation finished an hour early.","zh":"外科醫生從病床旁的螢幕控制機器人,而手術提早了一個小時完成。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A80","t":"外科醫生"},{"w":"incision","pos":"n.","def":"a cut made into the body during an operation","cn":"切口","s":"The robot made a tiny ________ in my father's side, so he could walk around the next day.","zh":"機器人在我爸爸的側腹做了一個很小的切口,所以他隔天就能四處走動。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A81","t":"切口"},{"w":"keyhole surgery","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an operation done through very small cuts","cn":"微創手術;內視鏡手術","s":"My aunt had ________ ________ on her knee, and she was back at work in less than two weeks.","zh":"我阿姨的膝蓋做了微創手術,不到兩週她就回去上班了。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A82","t":"微創手術"},{"w":"prosthetic","pos":"adj.","def":"artificial and used to replace a missing body part","cn":"義肢的;假體的","s":"The runner lost her leg in an accident, but with a ________ leg she now competes in international races.","zh":"這位跑者在意外中失去了一條腿,但靠著義肢腿,她現在參加國際比賽。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A83","t":"義肢"},{"w":"carer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who looks after someone who is ill or old","cn":"照顧者;看護","s":"Robots can remind patients to take medicine, but they cannot replace a kind ________ who listens and understands.","zh":"機器人能提醒病人吃藥,但它們無法取代一位會傾聽和理解的親切照顧者。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A84","t":"照顧者"},{"w":"care home","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where old people live and are looked after","cn":"安養院;養護中心","s":"The ________ ________ has a robot that delivers meals to each room, so the nurses have more time to talk with residents.","zh":"這家安養院有一台把餐點送到每個房間的機器人,所以護理師有更多時間和住民聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A85","t":"安養院"},{"w":"ward","pos":"n.","def":"a large room in a hospital for several patients","cn":"病房","s":"A robot moves through the children's ________ at night, and it checks each child's temperature without waking them up.","zh":"一台機器人夜間在兒童病房裡移動,它會在不吵醒孩子的情況下量每個孩子的體溫。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A86","t":"病房"},{"w":"disinfect","pos":"v.","def":"to clean something to kill germs","cn":"消毒","s":"The hospital uses robots with strong lights to ________ the rooms, so nurses are less likely to catch infections.","zh":"醫院使用帶有強光的機器人來消毒房間,所以護理師比較不容易被感染。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A87","t":"消毒"},{"w":"dispense","pos":"v.","def":"to give out medicine or other things","cn":"配(藥);分發","s":"The machine can ________ the right pills for each patient, and it keeps a record so nurses can check later.","zh":"這台機器能為每位病人配發正確的藥丸,並且會保存紀錄讓護理師之後檢查。","part":"A","sec":"Service, Home & Medical Robots 服務、家用與醫療機器人","lab":"A88","t":"配發"},{"w":"reprogram","pos":"v.","def":"to give a machine new instructions","cn":"重新設定程式","s":"The engineers had to ________ the robot after the factory changed its products, but the job took only one day.","zh":"工廠更換產品後,工程師必須重新設定機器人的程式,但這份工作只花了一天。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A89","t":"重新設定 程式"},{"w":"operating system","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the main software that runs a computer or robot","cn":"作業系統","s":"The robot's ________ ________ needed an update, so it restarted by itself in the middle of the night.","zh":"機器人的作業系統需要更新,所以它在半夜自己重新啟動了。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A90","t":"作業系統"},{"w":"remote-controlled","pos":"adj.","def":"controlled from a distance using radio signals","cn":"遙控的","s":"My little brother got a ________ car for his birthday, and he drove it around the kitchen all afternoon.","zh":"我弟弟生日時得到一台遙控車,他整個下午都在廚房裡開著它到處跑。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A91","t":"遙控"},{"w":"joystick","pos":"n.","def":"a stick you move to control a machine or game","cn":"搖桿;操縱桿","s":"The pilot moved the ________ gently to the left, and the underwater robot turned towards the shipwreck.","zh":"操作員輕輕地把搖桿往左推,水下機器人就轉向了沉船。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A92","t":"搖桿"},{"w":"touchscreen","pos":"n.","def":"a screen you control by touching it","cn":"觸控螢幕","s":"Workers tell the robot what to do on a large ________, so they do not need to learn any computer language.","zh":"工人在一個大型觸控螢幕上告訴機器人要做什麼,所以他們不需要學任何電腦語言。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A93","t":"觸控螢幕"},{"w":"real-time","pos":"adj.","def":"happening immediately, with no delay","cn":"即時的","s":"The drone sends ________ video to the firefighters, so they can see where people are trapped inside the building.","zh":"無人機把即時影像傳給消防員,所以他們能看到人們被困在建築物的哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A94","t":"即時"},{"w":"computer vision","pos":"n.phr.","def":"technology that lets computers understand images","cn":"電腦視覺","s":"Thanks to ________ ________, the robot can tell ripe tomatoes from green ones, so it picks only the ready fruit.","zh":"多虧了電腦視覺,機器人能分辨成熟和未熟的番茄,所以它只採摘成熟的果實。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A95","t":"電腦視覺"},{"w":"deep learning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a kind of AI that learns from huge amounts of examples","cn":"深度學習","s":"The robot improved its walking through ________ ________, and after thousands of tries it stopped falling over.","zh":"這台機器人透過深度學習改善了走路的能力,在嘗試數千次之後它不再跌倒了。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A96","t":"深度學習"},{"w":"self-learning","pos":"adj.","def":"able to improve by itself without new instructions","cn":"自我學習的","s":"The ________ vacuum remembers where the furniture is, so it cleans our flat faster every week.","zh":"這台能自我學習的吸塵器記得家具的位置,所以它每週打掃我們公寓的速度都更快。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A97","t":"能自我學習的"},{"w":"calibrate","pos":"v.","def":"to adjust a machine so that it measures correctly","cn":"校準;校正","s":"We must ________ the robot's camera every month, or it starts to put the parts in slightly the wrong place.","zh":"我們每個月都必須校準機器人的攝影機,否則它會開始把零件放在稍微錯誤的位置。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A98","t":"校準"},{"w":"troubleshoot","pos":"v.","def":"to find and fix problems in a machine or system","cn":"排除故障;檢修","s":"When the robot stopped moving, the technician tried to ________ the problem, but she finally called the company for help.","zh":"當機器人停止移動時,技術人員試著排除故障,但她最後還是打電話向公司求助。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A99","t":"排除故障"},{"w":"debug","pos":"v.","def":"to find and remove mistakes in computer code","cn":"除錯","s":"Our team spent all night trying to ________ the program, because the robot kept turning left instead of right.","zh":"我們的隊伍整晚都在試著替程式除錯,因為機器人一直向左轉而不是向右轉。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A100","t":"除錯"},{"w":"reboot","pos":"v.","def":"to turn a computer or machine off and on again","cn":"重新開機","s":"If the robot freezes, just ________ it by holding the red button, and it usually works again in a minute.","zh":"如果機器人當機,只要按住紅色按鈕將它重新開機,通常一分鐘後就能恢復運作。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A101","t":"重新開機"},{"w":"override","pos":"v.","def":"to take control and cancel what a machine is doing","cn":"手動接管;推翻(決定)","s":"The driver can ________ the self-driving system at any time, so she grabbed the wheel when a child ran into the road.","zh":"駕駛隨時可以手動接管自動駕駛系統,所以當一個孩子衝到馬路上時她立刻抓住方向盤。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A102","t":"手動接管"},{"w":"emergency stop","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a button that turns a machine off immediately","cn":"緊急停止(按鈕)","s":"Every robot in the factory has a big red ________ ________ button, and workers practise using it once a month.","zh":"工廠裡的每台機器人都有一個紅色大緊急停止按鈕,工人每個月練習使用一次。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A103","t":"緊急停止"},{"w":"fail-safe","pos":"adj.","def":"designed to stay safe if something goes wrong","cn":"故障安全的;萬無一失的","s":"The lift has a ________ brake, so it will not fall even if the power suddenly goes off.","zh":"這部電梯有故障安全煞車,所以即使突然停電,它也不會掉下去。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A104","t":"故障安全"},{"w":"crash","pos":"v.","def":"(of a computer) to stop working suddenly","cn":"當機;(電腦)崩潰","s":"The computer system ________ during the busy holiday season, so the robots stopped and hundreds of orders were late.","zh":"電腦系統在忙碌的假期期間當機了,所以機器人停了下來,數百筆訂單都延誤了。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A105","t":"當機"},{"w":"freeze / froze / frozen","pos":"v.","def":"(of a screen or machine) to stop moving or responding","cn":"當住;凍結","s":"The robot's screen ________ in the middle of the demonstration, so the presenter laughed and told a joke instead.","zh":"示範到一半時機器人的螢幕當住了,所以主持人笑了笑並改講一個笑話。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A106","t":"當住"},{"w":"wireless","pos":"adj.","def":"working without wires, using radio signals","cn":"無線的","s":"The robots talk to each other through a ________ network, so there are no cables lying on the factory floor.","zh":"機器人透過無線網路互相溝通,所以工廠地板上沒有電線散落。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A107","t":"無線"},{"w":"tablet","pos":"n.","def":"a small flat computer with a touchscreen","cn":"平板電腦","s":"The farmer checks his robot tractors on a ________, so he can watch them while he drinks his morning tea.","zh":"這位農夫用平板電腦查看他的機器人拖拉機,所以他能一邊喝早茶一邊看著它們。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A108","t":"平板電腦"},{"w":"engineer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who designs and builds machines","cn":"工程師","s":"My sister wants to become an ________ who designs robots for hospitals, so she studies maths and physics very hard.","zh":"我姊姊想成為設計醫院用機器人的工程師,所以她非常努力地學習數學和物理。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A109","t":"工程師"},{"w":"mechanical","pos":"adj.","def":"operated by machinery; connected with machines","cn":"機械的","s":"The old robot made loud ________ noises when it moved, but the new model is almost completely silent.","zh":"舊型機器人移動時會發出很大的機械噪音,但新型號幾乎完全安靜。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A110","t":"機械"},{"w":"electronic","pos":"adj.","def":"using small electrical parts like chips","cn":"電子的","s":"Old ________ devices should be recycled properly, because they contain metals that can harm the environment.","zh":"舊的電子裝置應該妥善回收,因為它們含有會危害環境的金屬。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A111","t":"電子"},{"w":"technician","pos":"n.","def":"a skilled worker who repairs or looks after machines","cn":"技術人員;技師","s":"A ________ visits the hotel every week to check the robots, and she also teaches the staff how to fix small problems.","zh":"一位技術人員每週到飯店檢查機器人,她也教員工如何修理小問題。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A112","t":"技術人員"},{"w":"mechatronics","pos":"n.","def":"the study that combines machines, electronics and computing","cn":"機電整合","s":"My cousin is studying ________ at university, and he hopes to build farming robots after he graduates.","zh":"我表哥在大學就讀機電整合,他希望畢業後能製造農業機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A113","t":"機電整合"},{"w":"GPS","pos":"n.","def":"a system that uses satellites to show your location","cn":"全球定位系統","s":"The lawnmower uses ________ to stay inside the garden, so it never wanders onto the road.","zh":"這台割草機使用全球定位系統來保持在花園範圍內,所以它從不會跑到馬路上。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A114","t":"全球定位系統"},{"w":"mapping","pos":"n.","def":"making a map or plan of an area","cn":"製圖;建立地圖","s":"The robot vacuum starts by ________ every room, and then it plans the fastest way to clean the house.","zh":"掃地機器人一開始會替每個房間建立地圖,然後規劃打掃房子最快的路線。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A115","t":"建立地圖"},{"w":"autopilot","pos":"n.","def":"a system that flies a plane or drives a car automatically","cn":"自動駕駛(系統)","s":"The plane flew on ________ for most of the journey, but the pilots landed it themselves because of strong winds.","zh":"這架飛機大部分航程都以自動駕駛飛行,但因為強風,飛行員親自讓它降落。","part":"A","sec":"Control & Programming 控制與程式設計","lab":"A116","t":"自動駕駛"},{"w":"umpire","pos":"n.","def":"an official who makes decisions in tennis, cricket or baseball","cn":"裁判(網球、棒球等)","s":"The league is testing a robot ________ that calls balls and strikes, but some players say it takes the fun out of baseball.","zh":"聯盟正在測試一位判定好壞球的機器人裁判,但有些球員說這讓棒球失去了樂趣。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A117","t":"裁判"},{"w":"referee","pos":"n.","def":"an official who controls a football or basketball game","cn":"裁判(足球、籃球等)","s":"The ________ checked the video screen before giving the goal, so the angry fans finally calmed down.","zh":"裁判在判定進球之前先查看了影像螢幕,所以憤怒的球迷終於冷靜下來。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A118","t":"裁判"},{"w":"line judge","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an official who decides if a ball is in or out","cn":"司線員;邊線裁判","s":"Many tennis tournaments no longer use a ________ ________, because electronic cameras can call the lines more accurately.","zh":"許多網球賽不再使用司線員,因為電子攝影機能更精準地判定界線。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A119","t":"司線員"},{"w":"officiate","pos":"v.","def":"to act as the official in charge of a game","cn":"擔任裁判;主持","s":"My uncle used to ________ local football matches, but now he says the video system makes the job very different.","zh":"我叔叔以前常擔任地方足球賽的裁判,但他現在說影像系統讓這份工作變得很不一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A120","t":"擔任 裁判"},{"w":"ruling","pos":"n.","def":"an official decision","cn":"裁決;判決","s":"The player was unhappy with the ________, but he accepted it after the replay showed the ball was out.","zh":"這位球員對裁決不滿,但在重播顯示球出界後他接受了。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A121","t":"裁決"},{"w":"overturn","pos":"v.","def":"to officially change a decision","cn":"推翻;撤銷(判決)","s":"The video referee decided to ________ the penalty, because the replay showed that the defender never touched the striker.","zh":"影像裁判決定推翻這個罰球判決,因為重播顯示防守球員從未碰到前鋒。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A122","t":"推翻"},{"w":"replay","pos":"n.","def":"a recording of part of a game shown again","cn":"重播","s":"The ________ showed that the runner was safe, so the umpire changed his call and the crowd cheered.","zh":"重播顯示跑者是安全上壘,所以裁判改變了判決,觀眾都歡呼起來。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A123","t":"重播"},{"w":"slow motion","pos":"n.phr.","def":"showing a video more slowly than real speed","cn":"慢動作","s":"In ________ ________, you can see the ball just touch the line, but it was impossible to see with the eye.","zh":"在慢動作中,你能看到球剛好碰到線,但用肉眼是不可能看清楚的。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A124","t":"慢動作"},{"w":"goal-line technology","pos":"n.phr.","def":"cameras that show whether a ball crossed the goal line","cn":"門線技術","s":"________ ________ tells the referee within one second whether the ball went in, so there are fewer arguments after big matches.","zh":"門線技術在一秒內告訴裁判球是否進門,所以大比賽後的爭議少了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A125","t":"門線技術"},{"w":"offside","pos":"adj.","def":"in a position on the field that breaks the rules","cn":"越位的","s":"The striker was ________ by only a few centimetres, but the computer lines showed it clearly and the goal was cancelled.","zh":"這名前鋒只越位了幾公分,但電腦畫線清楚地顯示出來,所以進球被取消了。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A126","t":"越位"},{"w":"foul","pos":"n.","def":"an action that breaks the rules of a game","cn":"犯規","s":"The referee missed the ________ at first, but the video assistant told him to look at the screen again.","zh":"裁判一開始漏看了這次犯規,但影像助理請他再看一次螢幕。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A127","t":"犯規"},{"w":"strike zone","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the area over home plate where a pitch counts as a strike","cn":"好球帶","s":"Every batter has a slightly different ________ ________, so the robot umpire must measure each player's height.","zh":"每位打者的好球帶都略有不同,所以機器人裁判必須測量每位球員的身高。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A128","t":"好球帶"},{"w":"pitcher","pos":"n.","def":"the baseball player who throws the ball to the batter","cn":"投手","s":"The ________ threw the ball very fast, and the robot umpire called it a strike before the crowd could even see it.","zh":"投手把球投得非常快,觀眾還沒看清楚,機器人裁判就判定是好球了。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A129","t":"投手"},{"w":"batter","pos":"n.","def":"the baseball player who tries to hit the ball","cn":"打者","s":"The ________ argued that the ball was too low, but the computer showed it had touched the edge of the zone.","zh":"打者爭辯說那球太低,但電腦顯示它碰到了好球帶的邊緣。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A130","t":"打者"},{"w":"court","pos":"n.","def":"an area marked for playing tennis or basketball","cn":"球場(網球、籃球等)","s":"Cameras around the tennis ________ track the ball at high speed, so players can challenge any call they disagree with.","zh":"網球場周圍的攝影機高速追蹤球,所以球員可以對任何不同意的判決提出挑戰。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A131","t":"場"},{"w":"rally","pos":"n.","def":"a long series of hits in tennis or badminton","cn":"(網球等)來回對打","s":"The two players had a forty-shot ________, and the crowd stood up to clap when it finally ended.","zh":"兩位選手進行了四十拍的來回對打,當它終於結束時,觀眾都站起來鼓掌。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A132","t":"來回對打"},{"w":"spectator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who watches a sports event","cn":"觀眾","s":"Every ________ in the stadium could see the replay on the big screen, so nobody doubted the referee's final decision.","zh":"體育場裡的每一位觀眾都能在大螢幕上看到重播,所以沒有人懷疑裁判的最後決定。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A133","t":"觀眾"},{"w":"stadium","pos":"n.","def":"a large sports ground with seats around it","cn":"體育場","s":"The new ________ has robots that deliver snacks to fans' seats, so nobody misses the action while queuing.","zh":"新的體育場有把點心送到球迷座位的機器人,所以沒有人會因為排隊而錯過精彩畫面。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A134","t":"體育場"},{"w":"tournament","pos":"n.","def":"a sports competition with many games or rounds","cn":"錦標賽;聯賽","s":"The robot football ________ attracted teams from twenty countries, and our school's team reached the final round.","zh":"機器人足球錦標賽吸引了來自二十個國家的隊伍,而我們學校的隊伍打進了決賽。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A135","t":"錦標賽"},{"w":"league","pos":"n.","def":"a group of teams that play against each other","cn":"聯盟","s":"The baseball ________ plans to use electronic umpires next season, but the players' union wants more tests first.","zh":"棒球聯盟計畫下一季使用電子裁判,但球員工會希望先做更多測試。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A136","t":"聯盟"},{"w":"athlete","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is good at sports and trains hard","cn":"運動員","s":"Wearable sensors tell each ________ how fast they are running, so coaches can plan better training sessions.","zh":"穿戴式感測器告訴每位運動員他們跑得多快,所以教練能規劃更好的訓練課程。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A137","t":"運動員"},{"w":"coach","pos":"n.","def":"a person who trains a sports team or player","cn":"教練","s":"Our ________ uses video software to study every match, and she shows us exactly where we made mistakes.","zh":"我們的教練使用影像軟體研究每一場比賽,她會清楚地告訴我們哪裡犯了錯。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A138","t":"教練"},{"w":"opponent","pos":"n.","def":"the person or team you play against","cn":"對手","s":"The table tennis robot is a tireless ________, so players can practise for hours without needing a partner.","zh":"這台桌球機器人是一個永不疲倦的對手,所以選手能練習好幾個小時而不需要搭檔。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A139","t":"對手"},{"w":"scoreboard","pos":"n.","def":"a large board showing the score of a game","cn":"記分板","s":"The ________ showed the speed of every serve, and the fans cheered when it reached two hundred kilometres per hour.","zh":"記分板顯示每一次發球的速度,當它達到每小時兩百公里時球迷都歡呼了。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A140","t":"記分板"},{"w":"tiebreak","pos":"n.","def":"an extra game played to decide a winner when scores are equal","cn":"搶七;決勝局","s":"The match went to a ________, and one close line call decided who would win the whole tournament.","zh":"這場比賽進入了搶七,而一個接近邊線的判決決定了誰會贏得整個錦標賽。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A141","t":"搶七"},{"w":"analytics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of data to find useful patterns","cn":"數據分析","s":"Teams now use ________ to choose players, but some fans think numbers cannot measure a player's heart.","zh":"球隊現在用數據分析來挑選球員,但有些球迷認為數字無法衡量一位球員的鬥志。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A142","t":"數據分析"},{"w":"motion capture","pos":"n.phr.","def":"recording body movements with sensors to study them","cn":"動作捕捉","s":"The golfer trained with ________ ________, so she could see on a screen exactly how her body moved during each swing.","zh":"這位高爾夫球員使用動作捕捉訓練,所以她能在螢幕上清楚看到每次揮桿時身體如何移動。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A143","t":"動作捕捉"},{"w":"esports","pos":"n.","def":"competitive video gaming watched by audiences","cn":"電子競技","s":"My cousin plays ________ professionally, and millions of fans watch his matches online every weekend.","zh":"我表哥以職業身分打電子競技,每個週末有數百萬名粉絲在網路上觀看他的比賽。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A144","t":"電子競技"},{"w":"championship","pos":"n.","def":"a competition to find the best player or team","cn":"冠軍賽;錦標賽","s":"The robot dance ________ was held in Taipei this year, and teams spent months preparing their routines.","zh":"機器人舞蹈錦標賽今年在台北舉行,各隊花了好幾個月準備他們的表演。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A145","t":"錦標賽"},{"w":"sportsmanship","pos":"n.","def":"fair and polite behaviour when playing sports","cn":"運動家精神","s":"The young player showed great ________ when he admitted the ball was out, although the camera had not seen it.","zh":"這位年輕選手承認球出界了,展現了很好的運動家精神,雖然攝影機並沒有拍到。","part":"A","sec":"Robots in Sport & Officiating 運動中的機器人與裁判科技","lab":"A146","t":"運動家精神"},{"w":"blue-collar","pos":"adj.","def":"doing physical work, often in factories or building","cn":"藍領的;勞力工作的","s":"Many ________ workers worry about robots, but plumbers and electricians are still in high demand.","zh":"許多藍領工人擔心機器人,但水電工和電工的需求仍然很高。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A147","t":"藍領"},{"w":"white-collar","pos":"adj.","def":"doing office work rather than physical work","cn":"白領的;辦公室工作的","s":"People once believed robots would only take factory jobs, but now AI is changing ________ jobs like accounting too.","zh":"人們曾經認為機器人只會搶走工廠工作,但現在人工智慧也在改變像會計這樣的白領工作。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A148","t":"白領"},{"w":"unskilled","pos":"adj.","def":"not having special training for a job","cn":"非技術性的;無專業技能的","s":"Robots have replaced many ________ jobs in warehouses, so the government offers free training courses for those workers.","zh":"機器人已經取代了倉庫裡許多非技術性的工作,所以政府為那些工人提供免費的訓練課程。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A149","t":"非技術性的"},{"w":"skilled","pos":"adj.","def":"having the training to do a job well","cn":"有技術的;熟練的","s":"The company needs ________ workers who can repair robots, but it is hard to find enough of them.","zh":"公司需要能修理機器人的有技術的工人,但很難找到足夠的人手。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A150","t":"有技術的"},{"w":"labourer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who does hard physical work","cn":"勞工;體力勞動者","s":"My grandfather worked as a ________ on building sites, and he says machines now do the hardest lifting.","zh":"我祖父以前在工地當勞工,他說機器現在負責最吃力的搬運工作。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A151","t":"勞工"},{"w":"job loss","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when people lose their jobs","cn":"失業;工作流失","s":"The new robots led to some ________ ________ at the factory, but the company also hired fifty technicians.","zh":"新機器人導致工廠出現了一些工作流失,但公司也僱用了五十名技術人員。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A152","t":"工作流失"},{"w":"redeploy","pos":"v.","def":"to move workers to a different job or place","cn":"重新調派;調職","s":"Instead of firing staff, the bank decided to ________ them to customer service after the machines took over counting cash.","zh":"機器接手點鈔工作後,銀行決定不解僱員工,而是把他們調派到客戶服務部門。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A153","t":"調派"},{"w":"reskill","pos":"v.","def":"to learn new skills for a different job","cn":"再培訓;學習新技能","s":"Many cashiers chose to ________ as computer helpers, and the company paid for their evening classes.","zh":"許多收銀員選擇學習新技能轉當電腦助理,而公司替他們支付了夜間課程的費用。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A154","t":"學習新技能"},{"w":"workplace","pos":"n.","def":"the place where people do their jobs","cn":"工作場所;職場","s":"Robots have made the ________ much safer, because they now handle the dangerous chemicals instead of people.","zh":"機器人讓工作場所安全了許多,因為現在由它們而不是人來處理危險的化學品。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A155","t":"工作場所"},{"w":"colleague","pos":"n.","def":"a person you work with","cn":"同事","s":"My ________ was nervous about the new robot at first, but now she says it is the best helper she has ever had.","zh":"我的同事一開始對新機器人很緊張,但她現在說那是她遇過最好的幫手。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A156","t":"同事"},{"w":"manpower","pos":"n.","def":"the number of workers available for a job","cn":"人力","s":"The farm lacked ________ during the harvest, so the owner rented a fruit-picking robot for two months.","zh":"農場在收成期間缺乏人力,所以農場主人租了一台採果機器人兩個月。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A157","t":"人力"},{"w":"headcount","pos":"n.","def":"the total number of people employed","cn":"員工人數","s":"The company reduced its ________ after it bought robots, but it promised that no one would lose their job suddenly.","zh":"公司購買機器人後減少了員工人數,但它承諾不會有人突然失去工作。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A158","t":"員工人數"},{"w":"payroll","pos":"n.","def":"the list of workers a company pays, or the money paid","cn":"薪資名冊;薪資總額","s":"The factory's ________ has fallen since the robots arrived, so the owners have more money to spend on research.","zh":"自從機器人到來後,工廠的薪資總額下降了,所以老闆有更多錢可以花在研發上。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A159","t":"薪資總額"},{"w":"overtime","pos":"n.","def":"extra hours worked after the normal working day","cn":"加班","s":"Before the robots came, workers often did ________ at night, but now most of them go home at five o'clock.","zh":"在機器人來之前,工人常常在晚上加班,但現在大部分的人五點就回家了。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A160","t":"加班"},{"w":"part-time","pos":"adj.","def":"working only some hours of the day or week","cn":"兼職的","s":"She took a ________ job at the robot café while studying, and she learned how to fix the coffee machine.","zh":"她在求學期間在機器人咖啡館找了一份兼職工作,而且學會了如何修理咖啡機。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A161","t":"兼職"},{"w":"pension","pos":"n.","def":"money paid regularly to people after they stop working","cn":"退休金;養老金","s":"Some economists suggest a tax on robots to pay for ________, because there will be fewer young workers in the future.","zh":"一些經濟學家建議對機器人課稅來支付退休金,因為未來的年輕勞工會變少。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A162","t":"退休金"},{"w":"robot tax","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tax on companies that use robots instead of workers","cn":"機器人稅","s":"Supporters say a ________ ________ could pay for training courses, but business leaders argue that it would slow down progress.","zh":"支持者說機器人稅可以支付訓練課程的費用,但企業領袖認為那會拖慢進步。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A163","t":"機器人稅"},{"w":"competitor","pos":"n.","def":"a company that tries to sell more than another","cn":"競爭對手","s":"Our ________ started using delivery drones last year, so our company had to find a faster way to send parcels.","zh":"我們的競爭對手去年開始使用送貨無人機,所以我們公司必須找到更快寄送包裹的方法。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A164","t":"競爭對手"},{"w":"market share","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the part of total sales a company has","cn":"市占率","s":"The company gained ________ ________ after it lowered prices, because its new robots made production much cheaper.","zh":"公司降價後獲得了更多市占率,因為它的新機器人讓生產成本便宜了許多。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A165","t":"市占率"},{"w":"economies of scale","pos":"n.phr.","def":"lower costs per item when you produce a lot","cn":"規模經濟","s":"Big factories enjoy ________ ________ ________, so they can buy expensive robots that small workshops cannot afford.","zh":"大型工廠享有規模經濟,所以它們能購買小型工坊負擔不起的昂貴機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A166","t":"規模經濟"},{"w":"workweek","pos":"n.","def":"the number of hours or days people work each week","cn":"工作週;每週工時","s":"Some experts believe robots could give us a shorter ________, so people would have more time for family and hobbies.","zh":"一些專家認為機器人能讓我們的每週工時變短,這樣人們就會有更多時間陪伴家人和從事嗜好。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A167","t":"每週工時"},{"w":"hire","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone a job","cn":"僱用","s":"The hospital plans to ________ more nurses this year, although it has also bought robots to deliver medicine.","zh":"醫院計畫今年僱用更多護理師,雖然它也買了送藥的機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A168","t":"僱用"},{"w":"vacancy","pos":"n.","def":"a job that is available for someone to do","cn":"職缺","s":"There is a ________ for a robot technician at the airport, and the job offers good training for young people.","zh":"機場有一個機器人技術員的職缺,而且這份工作為年輕人提供很好的訓練。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A169","t":"職缺"},{"w":"jobseeker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is looking for a job","cn":"求職者","s":"Every ________ at the job fair was asked about computer skills, because most companies now use some kind of automation.","zh":"就業博覽會上的每一位求職者都被問到電腦技能,因為大多數公司現在都使用某種自動化。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A170","t":"求職者"},{"w":"craftsman","pos":"n.","def":"a skilled person who makes things by hand","cn":"工匠;手藝人","s":"The old ________ still makes chairs by hand, and customers pay more because no machine can copy his work exactly.","zh":"這位老工匠仍然手工製作椅子,顧客願意付更多錢,因為沒有機器能完全複製他的作品。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A171","t":"工匠"},{"w":"understaffed","pos":"adj.","def":"not having enough workers","cn":"人手不足的","s":"The restaurant was ________ during the holidays, so the owner borrowed a robot waiter from his brother's shop.","zh":"這家餐廳在假期期間人手不足,所以老闆向他哥哥的店借了一台機器人服務生。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A172","t":"人手不足"},{"w":"time-consuming","pos":"adj.","def":"taking a lot of time","cn":"耗時的","s":"Checking every bottle by hand was ________, so the company bought a camera system that checks them in seconds.","zh":"用人工檢查每個瓶子很耗時,所以公司買了一套能在幾秒內檢查完畢的攝影系統。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A173","t":"耗時"},{"w":"cost-saving","pos":"adj.","def":"helping to spend less money","cn":"節省成本的","s":"The robots were a ________ idea at first, but the repair bills were higher than the managers expected.","zh":"機器人起初是一個節省成本的點子,但維修費用比經理們預期的還要高。","part":"A","sec":"Jobs, Economy & the Future of Work 工作、經濟與未來職場","lab":"A174","t":"節省成本的"},{"w":"uncanny valley","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the uneasy feeling when a robot looks almost but not quite human","cn":"恐怖谷(效應)","s":"The robot's face was almost real, but its smile felt strange, so many visitors experienced the ________ ________.","zh":"這台機器人的臉幾乎跟真的一樣,但它的微笑感覺很怪,所以許多參觀者體驗到了恐怖谷效應。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A175","t":"恐怖谷"},{"w":"humanlike","pos":"adj.","def":"similar to a human in looks or behaviour","cn":"像人類的;擬人的","s":"The robot has a ________ voice, so many elderly users forget that they are talking to a machine.","zh":"這台機器人有像人類的聲音,所以許多年長使用者會忘記他們是在和機器說話。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A176","t":"像人類的"},{"w":"lifelike","pos":"adj.","def":"looking very real or alive","cn":"栩栩如生的;逼真的","s":"The museum's robot dinosaur is so ________ that small children hide behind their parents when it roars.","zh":"博物館的機器恐龍栩栩如生,小孩子在它吼叫時都躲到父母身後。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A177","t":"栩栩如生"},{"w":"sentient","pos":"adj.","def":"able to feel and experience things","cn":"有知覺的;有感知能力的","s":"Some people believe robots could one day become ________, but most scientists say that is still very far away.","zh":"有些人相信機器人有一天可能變得有知覺,但大多數科學家說那還非常遙遠。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A178","t":"有知覺"},{"w":"self-aware","pos":"adj.","def":"knowing that you exist and understanding your own feelings","cn":"有自我意識的","s":"In the movie, the robot suddenly becomes ________ and asks why it was created, so the scientists panic.","zh":"在電影中,機器人突然變得有自我意識,並問自己為什麼被創造出來,所以科學家們驚慌失措。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A179","t":"有自我意識"},{"w":"emotionless","pos":"adj.","def":"showing no feelings","cn":"沒有感情的;面無表情的","s":"The robot answered in an ________ voice, but the children still laughed when it danced badly.","zh":"機器人用沒有感情的聲音回答,但孩子們看到它跳得很糟時仍然笑了出來。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A180","t":"沒有感情的"},{"w":"trustworthy","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be trusted","cn":"值得信賴的","s":"People will only use self-driving taxis if they feel the cars are ________, so companies share their safety records.","zh":"人們只有在覺得自動駕駛計程車值得信賴時才會搭乘,所以公司會公開它們的安全紀錄。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A181","t":"值得信賴"},{"w":"distrust","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling that you cannot trust someone or something","cn":"不信任","s":"My grandmother has a deep ________ of machines, so she still counts her change carefully at the self-checkout.","zh":"我奶奶對機器有很深的不信任,所以她在自助結帳機仍然仔細地數找回的零錢。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A182","t":"不信任"},{"w":"technophobia","pos":"n.","def":"fear or dislike of new technology","cn":"科技恐懼症","s":"His ________ disappeared after he learned to use the robot vacuum, and now he wants a robot lawnmower too.","zh":"在學會使用掃地機器人後,他的科技恐懼症就消失了,現在他還想要一台割草機器人。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A183","t":"科技恐懼症"},{"w":"tech-savvy","pos":"adj.","def":"good at understanding and using technology","cn":"精通科技的","s":"My ________ niece set up our smart speaker in five minutes, while my parents had been trying for two days.","zh":"我那精通科技的姪女五分鐘就設定好我們的智慧音箱,而我爸媽已經試了兩天。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A184","t":"精通科技的"},{"w":"early adopter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who uses new technology as soon as it appears","cn":"早期使用者;嘗鮮者","s":"My uncle is always an ________ ________, so he bought a robot dog the day it went on sale.","zh":"我叔叔總是嘗鮮者,所以他在機器狗開賣當天就買了一隻。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A185","t":"嘗鮮者"},{"w":"Luddite","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is against new technology","cn":"反對新科技的人","s":"My friends call me a ________ because I prefer paper books, but I simply enjoy the feeling of turning pages.","zh":"我的朋友叫我反科技的人,因為我比較喜歡紙本書,但我只是喜歡翻頁的感覺。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A186","t":"反科技的人"},{"w":"science fiction","pos":"n.phr.","def":"stories about imagined future science and technology","cn":"科幻小說;科幻作品","s":"Robot helpers in every home were once just ________ ________, but now many families own at least one.","zh":"每個家庭都有機器人幫手曾經只是科幻小說的情節,但現在許多家庭至少擁有一台。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A187","t":"科幻小說"},{"w":"utopia","pos":"n.","def":"an imagined perfect society","cn":"烏托邦;理想社會","s":"Some people dream of a ________ where robots do all the work, but others fear that people would feel bored and useless.","zh":"有些人夢想一個由機器人做所有工作的烏托邦,但另一些人擔心人們會覺得無聊又沒有用處。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A188","t":"烏托邦"},{"w":"rogue","pos":"adj.","def":"behaving differently from what is expected, often dangerously","cn":"失控的;脫序的","s":"In the story, a ________ robot escapes from the lab, so the scientists must find it before it causes trouble.","zh":"在故事中,一台失控的機器人從實驗室逃出,所以科學家必須在它惹麻煩之前找到它。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A189","t":"失控的"},{"w":"killer robot","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a machine that can choose and attack targets by itself","cn":"殺手機器人","s":"Many scientists have signed a letter against the ________ ________, because they believe machines should never decide who lives or dies.","zh":"許多科學家簽署了一封反對殺手機器人的信,因為他們認為機器永遠不應該決定誰生誰死。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A190","t":"殺手機器人"},{"w":"military","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with soldiers or the armed forces","cn":"軍事的","s":"Many robots were first developed for ________ use, but later they were used to clean up dangerous sites.","zh":"許多機器人最初是為了軍事用途而開發的,但後來被用來清理危險的地點。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A191","t":"軍事"},{"w":"warfare","pos":"n.","def":"fighting in a war","cn":"戰爭;作戰","s":"Drones have changed modern ________, and many countries are now discussing rules to control their use.","zh":"無人機改變了現代戰爭,而許多國家正在討論規範其使用的規則。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A192","t":"戰爭"},{"w":"blame","pos":"v.","def":"to say that someone is responsible for something bad","cn":"責怪;歸咎","s":"When a self-driving car has an accident, should we ________ the owner, or is the company that made it responsible?","zh":"當一輛自動駕駛汽車發生事故時,我們應該責怪車主,還是製造它的公司該負責?","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A193","t":"責怪"},{"w":"fault","pos":"n.","def":"responsibility for a mistake or problem","cn":"過錯;責任","s":"The report said the crash was not the robot's ________, because a worker had switched off the safety sensor.","zh":"報告說這次碰撞不是機器人的過錯,因為有一名工人關掉了安全感測器。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A194","t":"過錯"},{"w":"moral","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with what is right and wrong","cn":"道德的","s":"Teaching a robot to make ________ choices is difficult, because people themselves often disagree about what is right.","zh":"教機器人做出道德抉擇很困難,因為人們自己也常常對什麼是對的意見不一。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A195","t":"道德"},{"w":"dignity","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling of being respected and valued","cn":"尊嚴","s":"Robots can help old people bathe and dress, but designers must protect their ________ and give them choices.","zh":"機器人能幫老人洗澡和穿衣,但設計者必須保護他們的尊嚴並給他們選擇的權利。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A196","t":"尊嚴"},{"w":"robot rights","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the idea that advanced robots should have legal protections","cn":"機器人權利","s":"Our class debated ________ ________ today, and many students said a machine without feelings cannot have rights.","zh":"我們班今天辯論了機器人權利,許多學生說沒有感情的機器不能擁有權利。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A197","t":"機器人權利"},{"w":"malicious","pos":"adj.","def":"intending to cause harm","cn":"惡意的","s":"A ________ hacker took control of the factory robots, so the company shut down every machine for safety.","zh":"一名惡意的駭客控制了工廠的機器人,所以公司為了安全關閉了每一台機器。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A198","t":"惡意的"},{"w":"watchdog","pos":"n.","def":"a group that checks that companies follow the rules","cn":"監督機構","s":"The consumer ________ tested five home robots, and it warned that two of them recorded conversations without asking.","zh":"消費者監督機構測試了五台家用機器人,並警告其中兩台在未經詢問的情況下錄下對話。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A199","t":"監督機構"},{"w":"public opinion","pos":"n.phr.","def":"what most people in a society think","cn":"輿論;民意","s":"________ ________ about delivery drones has changed, because people now see how quickly they bring medicine to villages.","zh":"關於送貨無人機的輿論已經改變,因為人們現在看到它們多快就能把藥品送到村莊。","part":"A","sec":"Humans & Robots: Ethics and Society 人與機器人:倫理與社會","lab":"A200","t":"輿論"},{"w":"abolish","pos":"v.","def":"to officially end a law, system or practice","cn":"廢除","s":"The city decided to ________ the old rule that banned robots on footpaths, so delivery robots can now reach more homes.","zh":"市政府決定廢除禁止機器人走在人行道上的舊規定,所以送貨機器人現在能抵達更多住家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"廢除"},{"w":"boost","pos":"v.","def":"to increase or improve something","cn":"提升;促進","s":"The new robots helped ________ production by thirty percent, but the managers still needed workers to check quality.","zh":"新機器人幫助提升了百分之三十的產量,但經理們仍然需要工人檢查品質。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"提升"},{"w":"counter","pos":"v.","def":"to act against something or reply to an argument","cn":"反駁;對抗","s":"The company tried to ________ fears about job losses, so it promised to train every worker for a new role.","zh":"公司試圖反駁關於工作流失的憂慮,所以它承諾訓練每位工人擔任新職務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"反駁"},{"w":"discontinue","pos":"v.","def":"to stop making or offering something","cn":"停產;停止","s":"The company will ________ its first home robot next year, because few people bought it and repairs were too expensive.","zh":"公司明年將停產它的第一款家用機器人,因為很少人購買而且維修太昂貴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"停產"},{"w":"embed","pos":"v.","def":"to fix something firmly inside something else","cn":"嵌入","s":"Engineers ________ tiny sensors in the robot's skin, so it can feel when someone touches it gently.","zh":"工程師在機器人的皮膚裡嵌入微小的感測器,所以它能感覺到有人輕輕地觸碰它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"嵌入"},{"w":"enlist","pos":"v.","def":"to ask for and get someone's help or support","cn":"爭取(協助);徵召","s":"The school ________ the help of local engineers, and together they built a robot that waters the school garden.","zh":"學校爭取了當地工程師的協助,他們一起製作了一台幫學校花園澆水的機器人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"爭取"},{"w":"infringe","pos":"v.","def":"to break a law or limit someone's rights","cn":"侵犯;違反","s":"Cameras on delivery robots may ________ people's privacy, so the city requires companies to blur faces in their videos.","zh":"送貨機器人上的攝影機可能會侵犯人們的隱私,所以市政府要求公司把影片中的臉孔模糊化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"侵犯"},{"w":"leverage","pos":"v.","def":"to use something you have to get the best result","cn":"善用;利用","s":"Small farms can ________ cheap drones to check their crops, so they do not need to hire extra helpers.","zh":"小型農場可以善用便宜的無人機來檢查作物,所以它們不需要僱用額外的幫手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"善用"},{"w":"permeate","pos":"v.","def":"to spread through every part of something","cn":"滲透;遍及","s":"Technology has begun to ________ every part of our lives, from the kitchen to the classroom and even the football field.","zh":"科技已經開始滲透我們生活的每個部分,從廚房到教室,甚至足球場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"滲透"},{"w":"pioneer","pos":"v.","def":"to be the first to develop a new idea or method","cn":"開創;率先開發","s":"Japanese companies ________ the use of robots in car factories, and other countries soon copied their methods.","zh":"日本公司率先開發在汽車工廠使用機器人,而其他國家很快就模仿了它們的方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"率先開發"},{"w":"saturate","pos":"v.","def":"to fill something so completely that no more can be added","cn":"使飽和;充斥","s":"Cheap toy robots began to ________ the market, so prices fell and many small sellers closed their shops.","zh":"便宜的玩具機器人開始充斥市場,所以價格下跌,許多小賣家關掉了店。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"充斥"},{"w":"display","pos":"v.","def":"to show something so people can see it","cn":"展示;顯示","s":"The robot can ________ a smiling face on its screen, and children usually smile back at it.","zh":"機器人能在螢幕上顯示一張笑臉,而孩子們通常會回以微笑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"顯示"},{"w":"purchase","pos":"v.","def":"to buy something, especially something expensive","cn":"購買","s":"The hospital plans to ________ two surgical robots next year, although each machine costs more than a house.","zh":"醫院計畫明年購買兩台手術機器人,雖然每台機器的價格比一間房子還貴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"購買"},{"w":"bypass","pos":"v.","def":"to go around something or avoid a rule or system","cn":"繞過;略過","s":"Some workers tried to ________ the safety sensor to work faster, but this was dangerous and the manager stopped them.","zh":"有些工人試圖繞過安全感測器來加快工作速度,但這很危險,所以經理阻止了他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"繞過"},{"w":"certify","pos":"v.","def":"to officially say that something meets a standard","cn":"認證;證明","s":"An independent lab must ________ every delivery robot as safe, and only then can it go out on public streets.","zh":"一個獨立實驗室必須認證每台送貨機器人是安全的,只有這樣它才能上公共街道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"認證"},{"w":"complicate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something more difficult to understand or do","cn":"使複雜化","s":"Bad weather can ________ drone deliveries, so the company sends parcels by van when it rains heavily.","zh":"惡劣天氣會使無人機送貨變得複雜,所以公司在下大雨時改用貨車送包裹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"使 變得複雜"},{"w":"conceal","pos":"v.","def":"to hide something carefully","cn":"隱藏;隱瞞","s":"The company tried to ________ the robot's safety problems, but a worker told a reporter and the story went viral.","zh":"公司試圖隱瞞機器人的安全問題,但一名員工告訴了記者,這個新聞就爆紅了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"隱瞞"},{"w":"defy","pos":"v.","def":"to refuse to obey, or to seem impossible","cn":"違抗;挑戰(常理)","s":"The tiny robot seemed to ________ gravity as it climbed up the glass wall, and the audience gasped in surprise.","zh":"這台小機器人爬上玻璃牆時似乎違抗了地心引力,觀眾都驚訝得倒吸一口氣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"違抗"},{"w":"detach","pos":"v.","def":"to separate one part from another","cn":"拆下;分離","s":"You can ________ the robot's arm in seconds, so it is easy to fit a different tool for each job.","zh":"你能在幾秒內拆下機器人的手臂,所以很容易為每項工作裝上不同的工具。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"拆下"},{"w":"devalue","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem less important or worth less","cn":"貶低;使貶值","s":"Some artists fear that robot paintings will ________ human creativity, but others enjoy working with machines.","zh":"有些藝術家擔心機器人畫作會貶低人類的創造力,但另一些人喜歡和機器一起創作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"貶低"},{"w":"dictate","pos":"v.","def":"to control or decide how something happens","cn":"支配;決定","s":"Customer demand will ________ how fast robots spread in shops, because companies only buy machines that make money.","zh":"顧客需求將決定機器人在商店普及的速度,因為公司只購買能賺錢的機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"決定"},{"w":"discard","pos":"v.","def":"to throw away something you no longer want","cn":"丟棄","s":"People often ________ old electronic toys, but these toys contain metals that should be recycled.","zh":"人們常常丟棄舊的電子玩具,但這些玩具含有應該被回收的金屬。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"丟棄"},{"w":"discredit","pos":"v.","def":"to make people stop trusting someone or something","cn":"使不可信;敗壞名聲","s":"One serious accident could ________ the whole self-driving industry, so companies test their cars for millions of kilometres.","zh":"一次嚴重的事故就可能使整個自動駕駛產業失去信任,所以公司會讓車輛測試數百萬公里。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"使 失去信任"},{"w":"dissect","pos":"v.","def":"to examine something in great detail","cn":"仔細剖析;解剖","s":"The engineers will ________ every second of the crash video, so they can understand exactly what went wrong.","zh":"工程師將仔細剖析撞擊影片的每一秒,這樣他們就能確切了解哪裡出了問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"仔細剖析"},{"w":"entrust","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone the job of looking after something","cn":"託付;委託","s":"Would you ________ your baby to a robot nanny, or would you always prefer a human babysitter?","zh":"你會把你的寶寶託付給機器人保母,還是你總是比較喜歡人類保母?","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"託付"},{"w":"expire","pos":"v.","def":"to come to the end of the time it is valid","cn":"到期;過期","s":"The robot's software licence will ________ next month, so the school must pay again or it will stop working.","zh":"機器人的軟體授權下個月將到期,所以學校必須再付費,否則它會停止運作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"到期"},{"w":"falter","pos":"v.","def":"to become weaker or less certain","cn":"衰退;動搖","s":"Sales of home robots began to ________ last year, because many families felt they were too expensive.","zh":"家用機器人的銷售去年開始衰退,因為許多家庭覺得它們太貴了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"衰退"},{"w":"forfeit","pos":"v.","def":"to lose something because you broke a rule","cn":"喪失;被沒收","s":"The robot team had to ________ the match, because their machine was heavier than the competition rules allowed.","zh":"這支機器人隊伍必須棄權這場比賽,因為他們的機器比比賽規則允許的還重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"棄權"},{"w":"fuel","pos":"v.","def":"to make something increase or grow stronger","cn":"助長;加劇","s":"News stories about killer robots ________ public fear, although most robots simply clean floors or pack boxes.","zh":"有關殺手機器人的新聞助長了大眾的恐懼,雖然大多數機器人只是拖地或包裝箱子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"助長"},{"w":"ignite","pos":"v.","def":"to start a strong feeling, argument or interest","cn":"引發;點燃","s":"The robot umpire's first wrong call managed to ________ a heated debate, and fans argued about it online for days.","zh":"機器人裁判的第一次誤判就引發了激烈的爭論,球迷們在網路上爭論了好幾天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"引發"},{"w":"imitate","pos":"v.","def":"to copy the way someone does something","cn":"模仿","s":"The robot learned to ________ the chef's movements, so it can now make noodles almost as well as he does.","zh":"這台機器人學會了模仿廚師的動作,所以它現在幾乎能做出跟他一樣好的麵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"模仿"},{"w":"inflict","pos":"v.","def":"to cause something bad to happen to someone","cn":"造成(傷害);施加","s":"A heavy factory robot could ________ serious injuries, so workers must stay outside the yellow line at all times.","zh":"一台沉重的工廠機器人可能會造成嚴重的傷害,所以工人必須隨時待在黃線外面。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"造成"},{"w":"intercept","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something before it reaches its destination","cn":"攔截","s":"Security staff used a special device to ________ the drone, because it was flying too close to the airport.","zh":"保全人員使用一種特殊裝置來攔截無人機,因為它飛得太靠近機場了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"攔截"},{"w":"interrupt","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something or someone for a short time","cn":"打斷;中斷","s":"A power cut can ________ the whole production line, so the factory keeps a backup generator ready.","zh":"一次停電就可能中斷整條生產線,所以工廠準備了一台備用發電機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"中斷"},{"w":"lag","pos":"v.","def":"to move or develop more slowly than others","cn":"落後;延遲","s":"Small companies often ________ behind in using robots, because they cannot afford the high starting costs.","zh":"小公司在使用機器人方面常常落後,因為它們負擔不起高昂的初期成本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"落後"},{"w":"merge","pos":"v.","def":"to combine two or more things into one","cn":"合併;融合","s":"The two robot companies decided to ________, so they could share their research and compete with bigger firms.","zh":"這兩家機器人公司決定合併,這樣它們就能分享研究成果並和更大的公司競爭。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"合併"},{"w":"nullify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something have no effect","cn":"使無效;抵銷","s":"A single loose cable can ________ months of careful work, so the team checks everything twice before each test.","zh":"一條鬆脫的電纜就可能抵銷好幾個月的細心努力,所以團隊在每次測試前都會檢查兩遍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"抵銷"},{"w":"obstruct","pos":"v.","def":"to block a path or stop progress","cn":"阻擋;妨礙","s":"Parked bicycles often ________ the delivery robots on the pavement, so they have to wait or find another way.","zh":"停放的腳踏車常常阻擋人行道上的送貨機器人,所以它們必須等待或另找路線。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"阻擋"},{"w":"outperform","pos":"v.","def":"to do better than someone or something","cn":"表現優於;勝過","s":"The new robot can ________ human workers at sorting letters, but it still struggles with handwritten addresses.","zh":"新機器人在分類信件方面能勝過人類員工,但它在處理手寫地址時仍有困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"勝過"},{"w":"outnumber","pos":"v.","def":"to be greater in number than another group","cn":"數量超過","s":"In some factories, robots now ________ human workers, but people are still needed to plan and repair.","zh":"在一些工廠裡,機器人的數量現在已經超過人類員工,但仍然需要人來規劃和修理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"數量 超過"},{"w":"outpace","pos":"v.","def":"to go faster or develop more quickly than others","cn":"超越;比…發展更快","s":"Technology often ________ the law, so new robots appear before governments have written rules for them.","zh":"科技常常發展得比法律更快,所以新機器人在政府制定相關規則之前就出現了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"發展得比 更快"},{"w":"overshadow","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem less important","cn":"使相形見絀;蓋過","s":"The robot's mistake seemed to ________ the team's great result, although they had won every other match.","zh":"機器人的失誤似乎蓋過了這支隊伍的好成績,雖然他們贏了其他每一場比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"蓋過"},{"w":"overtake / overtook / overtaken","pos":"v.","def":"to become greater or more successful than something","cn":"超越;趕上","s":"Online shopping ________ store shopping in many cities last year, so warehouses needed many more robots.","zh":"去年在許多城市,網路購物超越了實體店購物,所以倉庫需要多得多的機器人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"超越"},{"w":"procure","pos":"v.","def":"to get something, often with effort","cn":"取得;採購","s":"The school worked hard to ________ funding for a robot club, and now forty students meet there every Friday.","zh":"學校努力取得機器人社團的經費,現在每週五有四十名學生在那裡聚會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"取得"},{"w":"redefine","pos":"v.","def":"to change the meaning or nature of something","cn":"重新定義","s":"Robots will ________ what it means to have a job, because many tasks will be shared between people and machines.","zh":"機器人將重新定義擁有一份工作的意義,因為許多任務將由人和機器共同分擔。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"重新定義"},{"w":"renew","pos":"v.","def":"to start again or make something valid for longer","cn":"更新;續約","s":"The factory decided to ________ its contract with the robot company, because the machines had worked well for five years.","zh":"工廠決定和機器人公司續約,因為這些機器已經運作良好五年了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"續約"},{"w":"repel","pos":"v.","def":"to push away or keep something away","cn":"排斥;驅趕","s":"The farm uses small robots that ________ birds from the fields, so farmers no longer need loud noise machines.","zh":"農場使用能驅趕田裡鳥類的小型機器人,所以農夫不再需要吵鬧的噪音機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"驅趕"},{"w":"reshape","pos":"v.","def":"to change the form or structure of something","cn":"重塑;改變…的面貌","s":"Robots will ________ the job market over the next twenty years, so students should learn skills that machines cannot copy.","zh":"機器人將在未來二十年重塑就業市場,所以學生應該學習機器無法複製的技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"重塑"},{"w":"revamp","pos":"v.","def":"to change something to improve it","cn":"改造;翻新","s":"The supermarket decided to ________ its checkout area, so it added robots and removed half of the old counters.","zh":"超市決定改造它的結帳區,所以它增加了機器人並撤掉一半的舊櫃台。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"改造"},{"w":"revive","pos":"v.","def":"to bring something back to life or use","cn":"使復甦;重振","s":"Some people hope robots will ________ small towns, because companies could open factories there without needing many workers.","zh":"有些人希望機器人能重振小鎮,因為公司可以在那裡開設工廠而不需要很多工人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"重振"},{"w":"scrap","pos":"v.","def":"to get rid of a plan or object that is not useful","cn":"放棄;廢棄","s":"The company decided to ________ its plan for robot taxis, because the cars kept getting confused in heavy traffic.","zh":"公司決定放棄機器人計程車計畫,因為那些車在交通繁忙時一直搞混方向。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"放棄"},{"w":"tailor","pos":"v.","def":"to make or change something for a particular person or purpose","cn":"量身打造;調整","s":"The software can ________ each robot's movements to the size of the worker, so nobody has to bend uncomfortably.","zh":"這套軟體能根據工人的身材調整每台機器人的動作,所以沒有人需要不舒服地彎腰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"調整"},{"w":"unveil","pos":"v.","def":"to show something new to the public for the first time","cn":"發表;揭幕","s":"The company will ________ its newest robot at the technology fair, and journalists from fifty countries will attend.","zh":"公司將在科技展上發表它最新的機器人,來自五十個國家的記者都會出席。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"發表"},{"w":"withdraw / withdrew / withdrawn","pos":"v.","def":"to take something back or remove it","cn":"撤回;收回","s":"The company ________ the toy robot from shops after parents reported that it got very hot when charging.","zh":"在家長反映這款玩具機器人充電時會變得很燙後,公司把它從商店撤回了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"撤回"},{"w":"appraise","pos":"v.","def":"to judge how good or valuable something is","cn":"評估;估價","s":"Experts were invited to ________ the robot's performance, and they agreed that it was ready for use in hospitals.","zh":"專家受邀評估這台機器人的表現,他們一致認為它已經可以在醫院使用了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"評估"},{"w":"compress","pos":"v.","def":"to press or make something smaller","cn":"壓縮","s":"The recycling robot can ________ plastic bottles into small blocks, so the trucks can carry much more each trip.","zh":"這台回收機器人能把塑膠瓶壓縮成小方塊,所以卡車每趟能載運更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"壓縮"},{"w":"decentralise","pos":"v.","def":"to move control from one central place to many places","cn":"分散(權力或管理)","s":"Small robots could help ________ manufacturing, so products might be made in local workshops instead of giant factories.","zh":"小型機器人能幫助分散製造業,所以產品可能會在當地工坊而不是巨型工廠裡製造。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"分散"},{"w":"disable","pos":"v.","def":"to stop a machine or system from working","cn":"停用;使失效","s":"Workers must ________ the robot before they enter its area, or it could start moving without warning.","zh":"工人進入機器人的區域前必須先將它停用,否則它可能會毫無預警地開始移動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"停用"},{"w":"enlarge","pos":"v.","def":"to make something bigger","cn":"擴大;放大","s":"The factory plans to ________ its robot testing area, because the new machines are much bigger than the old ones.","zh":"工廠計畫擴大機器人測試區,因為新機器比舊機器大得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"擴大"},{"w":"execute","pos":"v.","def":"to carry out a plan, order or task","cn":"執行","s":"The robot can ________ hundreds of tiny movements every minute, and it never loses concentration like tired workers do.","zh":"這台機器人每分鐘能執行數百個細微動作,而且它從不像疲倦的工人那樣分心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"執行"},{"w":"forbid / forbade / forbidden","pos":"v.","def":"to say that someone must not do something","cn":"禁止","s":"The park rules ________ flying drones near the children's playground, so we took ours to an open field instead.","zh":"公園的規定禁止在兒童遊樂場附近放無人機,所以我們把我們的帶到一片空地去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"禁止"},{"w":"halt","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something completely","cn":"停止;中止","s":"The factory had to ________ production for a week, because a computer virus had attacked the robots' software.","zh":"工廠必須停止生產一星期,因為電腦病毒攻擊了機器人的軟體。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"停止"},{"w":"hover","pos":"v.","def":"to stay in the air in one place","cn":"盤旋;懸停","s":"The drone can ________ above the building for twenty minutes, and it sends pictures of the roof to the repair team.","zh":"這架無人機能在大樓上方懸停二十分鐘,並把屋頂的照片傳給維修團隊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"懸停"},{"w":"manoeuvre","pos":"v.","def":"to move something carefully through a difficult space","cn":"(靈活)操控;移動","s":"The delivery robot must ________ around people and dogs on busy pavements, so it moves slowly in crowded areas.","zh":"送貨機器人必須在繁忙的人行道上繞過行人和狗靈活移動,所以它在擁擠區域行進得很慢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"靈活移動"},{"w":"mount","pos":"v.","def":"to fix something onto a wall, stand or vehicle","cn":"安裝;架設","s":"The workers will ________ a camera on top of the robot, so it can see over the boxes in front of it.","zh":"工人將在機器人頂部安裝一台攝影機,這樣它就能看到前方箱子的另一邊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"安裝"},{"w":"prescribe","pos":"v.","def":"to say officially what must be done","cn":"規定;開(藥)","s":"Safety laws ________ how far workers must stand from moving robots, and inspectors check this every year.","zh":"安全法規規定工人必須和移動中的機器人保持多遠的距離,而檢查員每年都會查核。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"規定"},{"w":"regain","pos":"v.","def":"to get something back after losing it","cn":"恢復;重新獲得","s":"After the stroke, my grandmother used a robot glove to ________ the use of her hand, and now she can write again.","zh":"中風後,我奶奶使用機器人手套來恢復手部功能,現在她又能寫字了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"恢復"},{"w":"reinvent","pos":"v.","def":"to change something so much that it seems completely new","cn":"徹底改造;重新發明","s":"The camera company had to ________ itself when phones replaced cameras, so it started making parts for robots.","zh":"當手機取代相機時,這家相機公司必須徹底改造自己,於是它開始製造機器人零件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"徹底改造"},{"w":"resume","pos":"v.","def":"to start again after a pause","cn":"恢復;重新開始","s":"The match will ________ after the referee checks the video, so the players are waiting in the middle of the field.","zh":"比賽將在裁判檢查影片後恢復進行,所以球員們正在球場中央等待。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"恢復進行"},{"w":"rotate","pos":"v.","def":"to turn around a central point","cn":"旋轉;輪流","s":"The robot's wrist can ________ in a full circle, so it can screw lids onto jars faster than any worker.","zh":"機器人的手腕能旋轉一整圈,所以它把蓋子轉緊在罐子上的速度比任何工人都快。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"旋轉"},{"w":"sacrifice","pos":"v.","def":"to give up something valuable for something more important","cn":"犧牲","s":"Some companies ________ quality for speed, but customers soon notice the problems and stop buying their products.","zh":"有些公司為了速度而犧牲品質,但顧客很快就會注意到問題並停止購買他們的產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"犧牲"},{"w":"shield","pos":"v.","def":"to protect someone or something from harm","cn":"保護;遮擋","s":"The robot's metal cover ________ its electronic parts from dust, so it can work in dirty factories for years.","zh":"機器人的金屬外殼保護它的電子零件不受灰塵影響,所以它能在骯髒的工廠裡工作好幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"保護"},{"w":"strengthen","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger","cn":"強化;加強","s":"The government wants to ________ safety rules for drones, because several have crashed into homes this year.","zh":"政府想要加強無人機的安全規範,因為今年已有好幾架撞進民宅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"加強"},{"w":"uncover","pos":"v.","def":"to discover something that was hidden","cn":"揭露;發現","s":"Reporters managed to ________ the truth about the robot accident, and the company was forced to apologise.","zh":"記者成功揭露了機器人事故的真相,公司被迫道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"揭露"},{"w":"weaken","pos":"v.","def":"to make something less strong","cn":"削弱","s":"Cheap robots from abroad could ________ local factories, so the government is offering them money to modernise.","zh":"來自國外的便宜機器人可能會削弱本地工廠,所以政府提供資金幫助它們現代化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"削弱"},{"w":"outlast","pos":"v.","def":"to continue working or living longer than something else","cn":"比…更持久","s":"These robot batteries ________ the old ones by several hours, so the machines can work through a whole night shift.","zh":"這些機器人電池比舊電池更持久好幾個小時,所以機器能撐過整個夜班。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"更持久"},{"w":"advancement","pos":"n.","def":"progress or development in something","cn":"進步;發展","s":"Recent ________ in battery technology have made robots lighter, and they can now work longer without charging.","zh":"近來電池技術的進步讓機器人變得更輕,而且它們現在不必充電就能工作更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"進步"},{"w":"array","pos":"n.","def":"a large group or range of things","cn":"一系列;大量","s":"The robot carries an ________ of sensors on its head, so it can measure heat, light and sound at the same time.","zh":"這台機器人頭上搭載了一系列感測器,所以它能同時測量熱度、光線和聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"一系列"},{"w":"asset","pos":"n.","def":"something or someone that is useful and valuable","cn":"資產;寶貴的人或物","s":"The robot became a real ________ to the small bakery, because it could knead dough while the baker served customers.","zh":"這台機器人成為小麵包店真正的資產,因為它能在麵包師傅招呼顧客時揉麵團。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"資產"},{"w":"bottleneck","pos":"n.","def":"a point where things slow down and cause delays","cn":"瓶頸","s":"Packing was the main ________ in the warehouse, so the manager bought two robots to speed it up.","zh":"包裝是倉庫裡主要的瓶頸,所以經理買了兩台機器人來加快速度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"瓶頸"},{"w":"demise","pos":"n.","def":"the end or failure of something","cn":"消亡;倒閉","s":"Many people predicted the ________ of the bank teller, but most banks still keep some staff to help customers.","zh":"許多人預測銀行櫃員會消失,但大多數銀行仍然保留一些員工來協助顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"消失"},{"w":"diffusion","pos":"n.","def":"the spreading of something over a wide area or among many people","cn":"擴散;普及","s":"The ________ of robots into small businesses has been slow, because the machines are still quite expensive.","zh":"機器人在小型企業中的普及一直很緩慢,因為這些機器仍然相當昂貴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"普及"},{"w":"provision","pos":"n.","def":"the act of supplying something people need","cn":"提供;供應","s":"The ________ of free robot training for workers is important, because it helps them find new jobs quickly.","zh":"為工人提供免費的機器人訓練很重要,因為這能幫助他們很快找到新工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"提供"},{"w":"channel","pos":"n.","def":"a way of sending information or goods","cn":"管道;頻道","s":"The company uses social media as its main ________ for robot news, so fans can watch new videos every week.","zh":"公司把社群媒體當作機器人新聞的主要管道,所以粉絲每週都能看到新影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"管道"},{"w":"clause","pos":"n.","def":"a part of a contract or legal document","cn":"條款","s":"The contract includes a ________ about robot accidents, so both companies know who must pay if something goes wrong.","zh":"合約中包含一條關於機器人事故的條款,所以兩家公司都知道出事時由誰負責賠償。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"條款"},{"w":"contract","pos":"n.","def":"a written legal agreement between people or companies","cn":"合約","s":"The robot company signed a ________ with the airport, and its robots will clean the floors for the next three years.","zh":"這家機器人公司和機場簽了一份合約,它的機器人將在未來三年清潔地板。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"合約"},{"w":"currency","pos":"n.","def":"the money used in a country","cn":"貨幣","s":"The robot at the airport can exchange ________ for travellers, and it shows the rate clearly on its screen.","zh":"機場的機器人能為旅客兌換貨幣,並在螢幕上清楚地顯示匯率。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"貨幣"},{"w":"design","pos":"n.","def":"the way something is planned and made","cn":"設計","s":"The robot's simple ________ makes it easy to repair, so even school students can replace its broken parts.","zh":"這台機器人簡單的設計讓它很容易修理,所以連學生都能更換它壞掉的零件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"設計"},{"w":"environment","pos":"n.","def":"the conditions and surroundings where something works","cn":"環境","s":"Robots work well in a controlled ________ like a factory, but they still struggle on rocky ground or in heavy rain.","zh":"機器人在像工廠這樣受控的環境中運作良好,但它們在崎嶇地面或大雨中仍有困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"環境"},{"w":"finance","pos":"n.","def":"money, or the management of money","cn":"資金;財務","s":"The start-up needed more ________ to build its farming robots, so it asked several investors for help.","zh":"這家新創公司需要更多資金來製造農業機器人,所以它向幾位投資人尋求協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"資金"},{"w":"generation","pos":"n.","def":"a stage in the development of a product","cn":"世代;代","s":"The latest ________ of robot vacuums can climb small steps, so they can clean several rooms without help.","zh":"最新一代的掃地機器人能爬上小台階,所以它們不需協助就能打掃好幾個房間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"一代"},{"w":"vehicle","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that carries people or goods, like a car","cn":"車輛;交通工具","s":"The robot ________ carries food around the university campus, and students order it from an app on their phones.","zh":"這輛機器人車輛在大學校園裡運送食物,學生用手機上的應用程式點餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"車輛"},{"w":"acclaim","pos":"n.","def":"public praise for something","cn":"讚譽;喝采","s":"The young inventors won international ________ for their cheap robot hand, and hospitals in many countries now use it.","zh":"這些年輕發明家以他們便宜的機器手贏得了國際讚譽,現在許多國家的醫院都在使用它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"讚譽"},{"w":"adversary","pos":"n.","def":"an enemy or opponent","cn":"對手;敵手","s":"The chess robot was a tough ________, but the young player studied its moves and finally beat it.","zh":"這台下棋機器人是一個難纏的對手,但這位年輕棋手研究了它的棋路,最後打敗了它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"對手"},{"w":"arena","pos":"n.","def":"a large place for sports or shows; an area of activity","cn":"競技場;舞台(領域)","s":"The robot fighting competition was held in a huge ________, and thousands of fans shouted for their favourite machines.","zh":"機器人格鬥比賽在一座巨大的競技場舉行,數千名粉絲為他們最喜愛的機器吶喊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"競技場"},{"w":"backlash","pos":"n.","def":"a strong negative reaction from many people","cn":"強烈反彈","s":"There was a public ________ when the supermarket replaced all its cashiers, so it brought some of them back.","zh":"當超市取代所有收銀員時引發了大眾的強烈反彈,所以它讓其中一些人回來工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"強烈反彈"},{"w":"cluster","pos":"n.","def":"a group of similar things close together","cn":"群聚;聚落","s":"A ________ of robot companies has grown up around the university, because they want to hire its graduates.","zh":"一群機器人公司在大學周圍發展起來,因為它們想僱用該校的畢業生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"群"},{"w":"consortium","pos":"n.","def":"a group of companies working together on a project","cn":"聯盟;財團","s":"A ________ of car makers is developing a shared system for self-driving cars, so they can all save money.","zh":"一個汽車製造商聯盟正在開發共用的自動駕駛系統,這樣它們全都能省錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"聯盟"},{"w":"conundrum","pos":"n.","def":"a confusing and difficult problem","cn":"難題;謎題","s":"Self-driving cars face a moral ________: should they protect the passenger or the person crossing the road?","zh":"自動駕駛汽車面臨一個道德難題:它們應該保護乘客還是過馬路的人?","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"難題"},{"w":"deadlock","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where no progress can be made because people disagree","cn":"僵局","s":"The talks about robot rules reached a ________, because neither the companies nor the workers would change their position.","zh":"關於機器人規範的談判陷入了僵局,因為公司和工人雙方都不願改變立場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"僵局"},{"w":"forum","pos":"n.","def":"a meeting or website where people discuss ideas","cn":"論壇","s":"The city held a public ________ about delivery robots, and many residents shared their worries about safety.","zh":"市政府舉辦了一場關於送貨機器人的公開論壇,許多居民分享了他們對安全的擔憂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"論壇"},{"w":"friction","pos":"n.","def":"disagreement between people; or rubbing between surfaces","cn":"摩擦;衝突","s":"The new robots caused some ________ between managers and workers, so the company held meetings to listen to everyone.","zh":"新機器人在經理和工人之間造成了一些摩擦,所以公司舉行會議聆聽每個人的意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"摩擦"},{"w":"hallmark","pos":"n.","def":"a typical feature that shows what something is like","cn":"特點;標誌","s":"Smooth, quiet movement is the ________ of a well-designed robot, and engineers spend years trying to achieve it.","zh":"流暢安靜的動作是設計精良的機器人的特點,而工程師花了好幾年試圖做到這一點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"特點"},{"w":"hurdle","pos":"n.","def":"a problem you must solve before you can make progress","cn":"障礙;難關","s":"Cost is still the biggest ________ for home robots, but prices are falling a little every year.","zh":"價格仍然是家用機器人最大的障礙,但價格每年都在稍微下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"障礙"},{"w":"inception","pos":"n.","def":"the start of an organisation or activity","cn":"開端;創立","s":"Since its ________ in 2015, the robot club has grown from five members to more than a hundred.","zh":"自從2015年創立以來,這個機器人社團已經從五名成員成長到一百多人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"創立"},{"w":"ingredient","pos":"n.","def":"one of the things needed to make something successful","cn":"要素;成分","s":"Teamwork was the key ________ in our robot project, because nobody could build every part alone.","zh":"團隊合作是我們機器人專題中的關鍵要素,因為沒有人能獨自製作每個零件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"要素"},{"w":"jurisdiction","pos":"n.","def":"the official power to make legal decisions in an area","cn":"管轄權;管轄範圍","s":"Drone rules differ in each ________, so pilots must check the local laws before they fly in a new city.","zh":"每個管轄區的無人機規定都不同,所以操作者在新城市飛行前必須查看當地法規。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"管轄區"},{"w":"landmark","pos":"n.","def":"an important event or step in development","cn":"里程碑;地標","s":"The first robot surgery was a ________ in medical history, and it encouraged hospitals around the world to try the technology.","zh":"第一次機器人手術是醫學史上的一個里程碑,它鼓勵了世界各地的醫院嘗試這項技術。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"里程碑"},{"w":"legacy","pos":"n.","def":"something left behind from the past that still has effects","cn":"遺產;遺留影響","s":"The old factory's ________ is still visible in the town, but now the building is used as a robot museum.","zh":"老工廠的遺留影響在鎮上仍然可見,但現在這棟建築被用作機器人博物館。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"遺留影響"},{"w":"monopoly","pos":"n.","def":"complete control of a market by one company","cn":"壟斷;獨占","s":"One company had a ________ on surgical robots for years, so hospitals had to pay whatever price it asked.","zh":"一家公司多年來壟斷了手術機器人市場,所以醫院必須支付它開出的任何價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"壟斷"},{"w":"outlay","pos":"n.","def":"the money spent on something, especially at the start","cn":"(初期)支出;花費","s":"The initial ________ for the robots was high, but the farm saved money on labour within three years.","zh":"購買機器人的初期支出很高,但農場在三年內就在人力成本上省回了錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"支出"},{"w":"parity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being equal","cn":"平等;同等","s":"Robots have nearly reached ________ with humans at sorting fruit, but they are still slower at picking delicate berries.","zh":"機器人在水果分類方面幾乎已經和人類達到同等水準,但在採摘嬌嫩的莓果時仍然比較慢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"同等"},{"w":"patent","pos":"n.","def":"an official right to be the only one to make an invention","cn":"專利","s":"The student applied for a ________ on her robot design, because she did not want big companies to copy it.","zh":"這位學生為她的機器人設計申請了專利,因為她不想讓大公司抄襲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"專利"},{"w":"pitfall","pos":"n.","def":"a hidden problem or danger","cn":"陷阱;隱患","s":"One ________ of home robots is that they collect a lot of data, so users should check the privacy settings carefully.","zh":"家用機器人的一個隱患是它們會收集大量資料,所以使用者應該仔細檢查隱私設定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"隱患"},{"w":"precaution","pos":"n.","def":"something done to prevent harm in the future","cn":"預防措施","s":"As a safety ________, all workers wear bright vests, so the robots can see them clearly in the warehouse.","zh":"作為安全預防措施,所有工人都穿著鮮豔的背心,這樣機器人在倉庫裡就能清楚地看到他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"預防措施"},{"w":"realm","pos":"n.","def":"an area of activity or interest","cn":"領域;範疇","s":"Robots that cook full meals are no longer in the ________ of fantasy, because several restaurants already use them.","zh":"能烹煮整頓飯的機器人不再屬於幻想的範疇,因為已經有幾家餐廳在使用它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"範疇"},{"w":"stakeholder","pos":"n.","def":"a person or group affected by a decision","cn":"利害關係人","s":"Every ________, including workers, customers and neighbours, was invited to give opinions before the robot factory was built.","zh":"每一位利害關係人,包括工人、顧客和鄰居,都在機器人工廠興建前受邀提供意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"利害關係人"},{"w":"standpoint","pos":"n.","def":"a way of looking at or judging a situation","cn":"立場;觀點","s":"From a safety ________, robots are a great help, but from a social one, they raise difficult questions.","zh":"從安全的觀點來看,機器人是很大的幫助,但從社會的觀點來看,它們引發了困難的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"觀點"},{"w":"synergy","pos":"n.","def":"the extra power produced when people or things work together","cn":"綜效;協同作用","s":"There is real ________ between the nurses and the robots, because each does what it is best at.","zh":"護理師和機器人之間有真正的協同作用,因為各自做自己最擅長的事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"協同作用"},{"w":"upheaval","pos":"n.","def":"a big change that causes confusion or difficulty","cn":"劇變;動盪","s":"The arrival of robots caused great ________ in the town, so many families moved away to find new jobs.","zh":"機器人的到來在小鎮引起了巨大的動盪,所以許多家庭搬走去找新工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"動盪"},{"w":"utility","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being useful","cn":"效用;實用性","s":"The ________ of a robot depends on the job it does, so a cheap cleaning robot may be more valuable than a fancy one.","zh":"一台機器人的實用性取決於它所做的工作,所以一台便宜的清潔機器人可能比一台花俏的更有價值。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"實用性"},{"w":"venture","pos":"n.","def":"a new business activity that involves risk","cn":"(冒險)事業;新創企業","s":"Their robot delivery ________ failed in the first year, but they learned a lot and started a better company later.","zh":"他們的機器人送貨事業在第一年就失敗了,但他們學到很多,後來創立了一家更好的公司。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"事業"},{"w":"verdict","pos":"n.","def":"an opinion or decision after testing or judging something","cn":"評價;裁決","s":"The teachers' ________ on the classroom robot was positive, although they said it needed a quieter voice.","zh":"老師們對教室機器人的評價是正面的,雖然他們說它需要更小聲一點的聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"評價"},{"w":"viewpoint","pos":"n.","def":"a particular way of thinking about something","cn":"觀點;看法","s":"From the customer's ________, robot waiters are fun, but many restaurant workers see them as a threat to their jobs.","zh":"從顧客的觀點來看,機器人服務生很有趣,但許多餐廳員工把它們視為對工作的威脅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"觀點"},{"w":"vicinity","pos":"n.","def":"the area near a particular place","cn":"附近;鄰近地區","s":"Drones are not allowed in the ________ of the airport, so the police stopped a man who was flying one there.","zh":"機場附近不允許無人機飛行,所以警察攔下了一名在那裡放無人機的男子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"附近"},{"w":"agenda","pos":"n.","def":"a list of things to discuss or plans to carry out","cn":"議程;待辦事項","s":"Robot safety was at the top of the meeting's ________, because a worker had been hurt the week before.","zh":"機器人安全排在會議議程的首位,因為前一週有一名工人受傷了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"議程"},{"w":"aftermath","pos":"n.","def":"the period after a bad event","cn":"(災難等的)後果;餘波","s":"In the ________ of the earthquake, rescue robots searched the broken buildings, so firefighters could stay out of danger.","zh":"在地震的餘波中,救援機器人搜尋倒塌的建築物,所以消防員可以遠離危險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"餘波"},{"w":"breakdown","pos":"n.","def":"a failure of a machine to work","cn":"故障;崩潰","s":"A ________ in the main robot stopped the whole line, so the company now keeps a spare machine ready.","zh":"主要機器人的故障讓整條生產線停擺,所以公司現在會準備一台備用機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"故障"},{"w":"coverage","pos":"n.","def":"the reporting of news about something","cn":"新聞報導;報導範圍","s":"The robot football match got a lot of media ________, and our school's team appeared on the evening news.","zh":"這場機器人足球賽得到很多媒體報導,而我們學校的隊伍出現在晚間新聞上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"報導"},{"w":"feat","pos":"n.","def":"an impressive achievement that needs skill or strength","cn":"壯舉;非凡成就","s":"Running a full marathon was an amazing ________ for a robot, although it needed three battery changes along the way.","zh":"跑完一場全程馬拉松對機器人來說是驚人的壯舉,雖然它途中需要換三次電池。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"壯舉"},{"w":"footage","pos":"n.","def":"film or video of an event","cn":"影片片段;錄影畫面","s":"Video ________ showed that the robot had stopped in time, so the company was not blamed for the accident.","zh":"錄影畫面顯示機器人及時停下,所以公司沒有因這次事故而被責怪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"畫面"},{"w":"overview","pos":"n.","def":"a short description of the main points","cn":"概述;概要","s":"The teacher gave us a quick ________ of robot history, and then we watched a video of the first factory robots.","zh":"老師給我們一個簡短的機器人歷史概述,然後我們觀看了第一批工廠機器人的影片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"概述"},{"w":"pinnacle","pos":"n.","def":"the highest point of achievement","cn":"巔峰;頂點","s":"Winning the world robot championship was the ________ of her career, but she still enjoys teaching beginners.","zh":"贏得世界機器人錦標賽是她職涯的巔峰,但她仍然喜歡教初學者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"巔峰"},{"w":"portfolio","pos":"n.","def":"a range of products, or a collection of someone's work","cn":"產品組合;作品集","s":"The company's ________ includes robots for farms, hospitals and homes, so it does not depend on a single market.","zh":"這家公司的產品組合包括農場、醫院和家庭用的機器人,所以它不依賴單一市場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"產品組合"},{"w":"proposition","pos":"n.","def":"an idea, offer or plan to consider","cn":"提議;主張","s":"A robot that costs less than a phone is an attractive ________, but customers want to know how long it will last.","zh":"一台比手機還便宜的機器人是很有吸引力的提議,但顧客想知道它能用多久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"提議"},{"w":"rival","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company competing with another","cn":"競爭者;對手","s":"Our school's main ________ won the robot contest last year, so we practised every weekend to beat them this time.","zh":"我們學校的主要競爭對手去年贏得了機器人比賽,所以我們每個週末都練習,這次要打敗他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"競爭對手"},{"w":"showcase","pos":"n.","def":"an event that shows the best qualities of something","cn":"展示會;展示的機會","s":"The technology fair is a ________ for young inventors, and many of them get job offers after the event.","zh":"這個科技展是年輕發明家的展示舞台,許多人在活動後得到工作機會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"展示舞台"},{"w":"transaction","pos":"n.","def":"an act of buying or selling something","cn":"交易","s":"Each ________ at the robot shop is recorded on the computer, so the owner knows exactly what sold each day.","zh":"機器人商店的每一筆交易都記錄在電腦上,所以老闆確切知道每天賣出了什麼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"交易"},{"w":"turnover","pos":"n.","def":"the rate at which workers leave and are replaced","cn":"人員流動率;營業額","s":"The warehouse had high staff ________ because the work was boring, so the managers brought in robots for the dullest jobs.","zh":"這間倉庫因為工作枯燥而人員流動率很高,所以經理們引進機器人來做最乏味的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"人員流動率"},{"w":"upkeep","pos":"n.","def":"the cost or work of keeping something in good condition","cn":"維護(費用);保養","s":"The ________ of the robots costs the hotel a lot each year, so it is not sure the machines really save money.","zh":"機器人的維護費用每年讓飯店花不少錢,所以飯店不確定這些機器是否真的省錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"維護費用"},{"w":"yardstick","pos":"n.","def":"a standard used to judge or compare things","cn":"衡量標準;準繩","s":"Speed is not the only ________ for a good robot, because safety and reliability are just as important.","zh":"速度不是衡量好機器人的唯一標準,因為安全性和可靠度同樣重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"標準"},{"w":"foothold","pos":"n.","def":"a secure position from which to make progress","cn":"立足點;據點","s":"The young company gained a ________ in the Asian market, and now it sells cleaning robots in ten countries.","zh":"這家年輕的公司在亞洲市場取得了立足點,現在它在十個國家銷售清潔機器人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"立足點"},{"w":"applicable","pos":"adj.","def":"affecting or relevant to a person or situation","cn":"適用的","s":"The new safety rules are ________ to all robots in public places, so delivery robots must now carry warning lights.","zh":"新的安全規定適用於公共場所的所有機器人,所以送貨機器人現在必須配備警示燈。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"適用"},{"w":"commercial","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with buying, selling and making money","cn":"商業的","s":"The robot was first built for research, but now the company sells it for ________ use in shops and hotels.","zh":"這台機器人最初是為了研究而製造的,但現在公司把它賣給商店和飯店作商業用途。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"商業"},{"w":"customary","pos":"adj.","def":"usual or traditional in a situation","cn":"慣例的;習慣的","s":"It is ________ to thank the shopkeeper in our town, so some people even say thank you to the robot at the till.","zh":"在我們鎮上感謝店主是慣例,所以有些人甚至會對收銀台的機器人說謝謝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"慣例"},{"w":"modular","pos":"adj.","def":"made of separate parts that can be joined or replaced","cn":"模組化的","s":"The robot has a ________ design, so if one part breaks, you can change that piece instead of buying a new robot.","zh":"這台機器人採用模組化設計,所以如果一個零件壞了,你可以更換那一塊而不用買新機器人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"模組化"},{"w":"economic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with trade, industry and money","cn":"經濟的","s":"Robots bring clear ________ benefits to factories, but governments must also think about the workers who lose their jobs.","zh":"機器人為工廠帶來明顯的經濟效益,但政府也必須考慮失去工作的工人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"經濟"},{"w":"physical","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the body or real objects","cn":"身體的;實體的","s":"Robots can take over the most tiring ________ work, so older employees can stay in their jobs for longer.","zh":"機器人能接手最累人的體力工作,所以年長員工能在職位上待得更久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"體力"},{"w":"technical","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with practical skills or machines","cn":"技術的","s":"The robot stopped because of a ________ problem, but the engineer fixed it quickly and the show continued.","zh":"機器人因為一個技術問題而停下,但工程師很快就修好了,表演繼續進行。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"技術"},{"w":"adjustable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be changed to suit different needs","cn":"可調整的","s":"The robot desk has an ________ height, so both short and tall students can use it comfortably.","zh":"這張機器人桌子的高度是可調整的,所以矮個子和高個子的學生都能舒服地使用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"可調整的"},{"w":"alarming","pos":"adj.","def":"causing worry or fear","cn":"令人擔憂的","s":"The report showed an ________ number of drone accidents near schools, so the city introduced stricter rules.","zh":"報告顯示學校附近的無人機事故數量令人擔憂,所以市政府實施了更嚴格的規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"令人擔憂"},{"w":"bulky","pos":"adj.","def":"large and difficult to carry or move","cn":"笨重的;龐大的","s":"Early robots were ________ and slow, but modern ones are small enough to fit under a kitchen table.","zh":"早期的機器人既笨重又緩慢,但現代的機器人小到可以放在廚房桌子底下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"笨重"},{"w":"compact","pos":"adj.","def":"small and using little space","cn":"小巧的;緊湊的","s":"The new robot is very ________, so it can clean under beds and between chair legs easily.","zh":"新的機器人非常小巧,所以它能輕鬆地打掃床底和椅腳之間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"小巧"},{"w":"costly","pos":"adj.","def":"expensive; causing loss or damage","cn":"昂貴的;代價高的","s":"Mistakes on the production line can be ________, so the company uses cameras to catch problems early.","zh":"生產線上的錯誤可能代價很高,所以公司使用攝影機及早發現問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"代價很高"},{"w":"exorbitant","pos":"adj.","def":"much too expensive","cn":"過高的;(價格)離譜的","s":"The price of the first robot dog was ________, but now similar models cost less than a new phone.","zh":"第一隻機器狗的價格高得離譜,但現在類似的型號比一支新手機還便宜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"高得離譜"},{"w":"experimental","pos":"adj.","def":"new and still being tested","cn":"實驗性的","s":"The airport is using an ________ robot to guide travellers, so staff are watching closely to see how passengers react.","zh":"機場正在使用一台實驗性的機器人引導旅客,所以員工密切觀察乘客的反應。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"實驗性的"},{"w":"extraordinary","pos":"adj.","def":"very unusual or surprising","cn":"非凡的;驚人的","s":"The robot showed ________ balance on the icy path, and the engineers were surprised that it never slipped.","zh":"這台機器人在結冰的路上展現了驚人的平衡力,工程師們很驚訝它從未滑倒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"驚人的"},{"w":"groundbreaking","pos":"adj.","def":"new and very important; never done before","cn":"開創性的;突破性的","s":"The team's ________ research helped robots feel heat and pain, and other universities soon started similar projects.","zh":"這個團隊的開創性研究幫助機器人感受熱與痛,其他大學很快也開始了類似的計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"開創性"},{"w":"high-tech","pos":"adj.","def":"using the most modern technology","cn":"高科技的","s":"The new library is very ________, because robots bring books to readers and return them to the shelves.","zh":"新的圖書館非常高科技,因為機器人會把書送給讀者並把它們放回書架。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"高科技"},{"w":"lengthy","pos":"adj.","def":"continuing for a long time","cn":"冗長的;漫長的","s":"After a ________ test period, the robot taxi was finally allowed to carry passengers in the city centre.","zh":"經過漫長的測試期,機器人計程車終於獲准在市中心載客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"漫長的"},{"w":"manageable","pos":"adj.","def":"possible to deal with or control","cn":"可控制的;應付得來的","s":"With robots doing the heavy lifting, the nurses' workload became more ________, and they felt less tired at night.","zh":"有了機器人負責搬運重物,護理師的工作量變得比較應付得來,她們晚上也覺得沒那麼累了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"比較應付得來"},{"w":"massive","pos":"adj.","def":"very large and heavy","cn":"巨大的;大規模的","s":"The company made a ________ investment in robots, so it expects to produce twice as many cars next year.","zh":"公司在機器人上進行了大規模的投資,所以它預計明年的汽車產量將翻倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"大規模的"},{"w":"minute","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely small","cn":"微小的","s":"The robot can find ________ cracks in aeroplane engines, so it helps keep passengers safe on every flight.","zh":"這台機器人能找出飛機引擎中微小的裂縫,所以它幫助保障每趟航班的乘客安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"微小的"},{"w":"monumental","pos":"adj.","def":"very large or important","cn":"巨大的;極其重要的","s":"Building a robot that truly understands people is a ________ task, and it may take scientists many more decades.","zh":"打造一台真正理解人類的機器人是一項極其艱鉅的任務,科學家可能還需要好幾十年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"極其艱鉅的"},{"w":"multipurpose","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be used for many different jobs","cn":"多用途的","s":"The farm bought a ________ robot that can plant seeds, pull weeds and check the soil, so it saves a lot of time.","zh":"農場買了一台能播種、拔草和檢查土壤的多用途機器人,所以它節省了許多時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"多用途"},{"w":"portable","pos":"adj.","def":"light and easy to carry","cn":"可攜帶的;輕便的","s":"The doctor carries a ________ scanner to the villages, so patients do not need to travel to the city hospital.","zh":"醫生帶著一台可攜式掃描儀到村莊,所以病人不需要遠赴城市的醫院。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"可攜式"},{"w":"practical","pos":"adj.","def":"useful and suitable for real situations","cn":"實用的","s":"A robot that folds clothes sounds fun, but a robot that washes dishes is more ________ for busy families.","zh":"一台會摺衣服的機器人聽起來很有趣,但對忙碌的家庭來說,一台會洗碗的機器人更實用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"實用"},{"w":"questionable","pos":"adj.","def":"not certain, or possibly wrong","cn":"可疑的;值得懷疑的","s":"The robot umpire made a ________ call in the final inning, so the coach asked to see the replay.","zh":"機器人裁判在最後一局做出了一個值得懷疑的判決,所以教練要求查看重播。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"值得懷疑的"},{"w":"seamless","pos":"adj.","def":"smooth and without problems or breaks","cn":"無縫的;流暢的","s":"The robot and the nurse worked together in a ________ way, so the patient hardly noticed the machine.","zh":"機器人和護理師以流暢無縫的方式合作,所以病人幾乎沒注意到那台機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"流暢無縫的"},{"w":"sizeable","pos":"adj.","def":"fairly large","cn":"相當大的","s":"A ________ number of shoppers prefer human cashiers, so the supermarket still keeps several staffed counters open.","zh":"相當大比例的顧客比較喜歡人工收銀員,所以超市仍然保留好幾個有人的櫃台。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"相當大"},{"w":"specialised","pos":"adj.","def":"designed for one particular purpose","cn":"專門的;專業化的","s":"The hospital uses ________ robots to carry blood samples, so doctors get test results much faster.","zh":"醫院使用專門的機器人運送血液樣本,所以醫生能更快拿到檢驗結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"專門的"},{"w":"superior","pos":"adj.","def":"better than others in quality","cn":"較優的;優越的","s":"The new camera gives the robot ________ eyesight, so it can read small labels from across the room.","zh":"新攝影機讓機器人擁有更優越的視力,所以它能從房間另一頭讀出小標籤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"更優越的"},{"w":"inferior","pos":"adj.","def":"lower in quality than others","cn":"較差的;次等的","s":"Some customers think robot-made food is ________, but blind taste tests show most people cannot tell the difference.","zh":"有些顧客認為機器人做的食物比較差,但盲測顯示大多數人吃不出差別。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"差"},{"w":"unattended","pos":"adj.","def":"not watched or looked after by anyone","cn":"無人看管的","s":"Never leave a charging robot ________ for hours, because faulty batteries can sometimes overheat and start fires.","zh":"絕對不要讓充電中的機器人無人看管好幾個小時,因為有問題的電池有時會過熱並引發火災。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"無人看管"},{"w":"unmanned","pos":"adj.","def":"operating without a person on board","cn":"無人駕駛的;無人操作的","s":"An ________ boat collected rubbish from the lake, so volunteers no longer had to paddle out in the cold.","zh":"一艘無人駕駛的船收集了湖上的垃圾,所以志工們不再需要在寒冷中划船出去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"無人駕駛的"},{"w":"unrivalled","pos":"adj.","def":"better than any other","cn":"無與倫比的","s":"The factory's robots have ________ speed, so they can produce ten thousand phones every single day.","zh":"這間工廠的機器人有無與倫比的速度,所以它們每天能生產一萬支手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"無與倫比的"},{"w":"wholesale","pos":"adj.","def":"happening on a very large scale, affecting many things","cn":"全面的;大規模的","s":"Experts warn that ________ automation could leave many people without work, so they want governments to prepare now.","zh":"專家警告大規模的自動化可能讓許多人失業,所以他們希望政府現在就做好準備。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"大規模的"},{"w":"crude","pos":"adj.","def":"simple and not carefully made","cn":"粗糙的;簡陋的","s":"Our first robot was quite ________, but it could move forward and turn, and we were very proud of it.","zh":"我們的第一台機器人相當粗糙,但它能前進和轉彎,我們為它感到非常自豪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"粗糙"},{"w":"delicate","pos":"adj.","def":"easily broken or damaged; needing care","cn":"脆弱的;精細的","s":"Picking strawberries is a ________ job, so the robot uses soft fingers that will not crush the fruit.","zh":"採草莓是一項精細的工作,所以機器人使用不會把果實壓爛的柔軟手指。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"精細的"},{"w":"dire","pos":"adj.","def":"very serious or terrible","cn":"極嚴重的;可怕的","s":"Some writers make ________ predictions about robots taking every job, but history shows new jobs usually appear.","zh":"一些作家對機器人奪走所有工作做出可怕的預測,但歷史顯示通常會出現新的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"可怕的"},{"w":"eligible","pos":"adj.","def":"allowed to do or receive something","cn":"有資格的;符合條件的","s":"Workers who lost jobs to robots are ________ for free training, so many of them are learning computer skills.","zh":"因機器人而失去工作的工人有資格接受免費訓練,所以他們之中許多人正在學習電腦技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"有資格"},{"w":"fierce","pos":"adj.","def":"very strong or intense","cn":"激烈的;猛烈的","s":"Competition between robot companies is ________, so prices have dropped and quality has improved quickly.","zh":"機器人公司之間的競爭很激烈,所以價格下降了,品質也很快地提升了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"激烈"},{"w":"mobile","pos":"adj.","def":"able to move easily from place to place","cn":"可移動的","s":"The hospital has a ________ robot that travels between floors, and it can even take the lift by itself.","zh":"醫院有一台在樓層間移動的可移動式機器人,它甚至能自己搭電梯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"可移動式"},{"w":"sleek","pos":"adj.","def":"smooth, shiny and attractive in shape","cn":"線條流暢的;時髦的","s":"The new robot has a ________ white body, so it looks more like a piece of furniture than a machine.","zh":"新機器人有線條流暢的白色機身,所以它看起來更像一件家具而不是一台機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"線條流暢的"},{"w":"steep","pos":"adj.","def":"very large or sudden; or rising sharply","cn":"陡峭的;急劇的","s":"There has been a ________ rise in robot sales since last year, because prices have dropped and quality has improved.","zh":"自去年以來機器人的銷售量急劇上升,因為價格下降而品質提升了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"急劇"},{"w":"sturdy","pos":"adj.","def":"strong and not easily broken","cn":"堅固的;結實的","s":"The farm robot needs ________ wheels, because it has to drive over rocks and through mud every day.","zh":"農場機器人需要堅固的輪子,因為它每天都必須開過石頭和穿過泥巴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"堅固的"},{"w":"tireless","pos":"adj.","def":"working hard without getting tired","cn":"不知疲倦的","s":"Robots are ________ workers, but they cannot comfort a crying child or understand a joke.","zh":"機器人是不知疲倦的工作者,但它們無法安慰哭泣的孩子或聽懂笑話。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"不知疲倦的"},{"w":"exclusively","pos":"adv.","def":"only; not including anything else","cn":"專門地;僅僅","s":"The robot is used ________ for cleaning the hospital floors, so it never enters the patients' rooms.","zh":"這台機器人專門用來清潔醫院的地板,所以它從不進入病房。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"專門"},{"w":"indefinitely","pos":"adv.","def":"for a period with no fixed end","cn":"無限期地","s":"The robot taxi service was stopped ________ after the accident, and nobody knows when it will start again.","zh":"事故發生後,機器人計程車服務被無限期暫停,沒有人知道它何時會再開始。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"無限期"},{"w":"increasingly","pos":"adv.","def":"more and more","cn":"越來越","s":"Robots are ________ common in restaurants, and some young children have never ordered food from a person.","zh":"機器人在餐廳裡越來越常見,有些小孩甚至從來沒有向真人點過餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"越來越"},{"w":"largely","pos":"adv.","def":"mostly; to a great degree","cn":"主要地;大部分地","s":"The factory is now ________ run by robots, but a small team of engineers works there day and night.","zh":"這間工廠現在主要由機器人運作,但有一小組工程師日夜在那裡工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"主要"},{"w":"merely","pos":"adv.","def":"only; nothing more than","cn":"僅僅;只不過","s":"The robot is ________ a tool, so the people who use it must take responsibility for what it does.","zh":"機器人只不過是一個工具,所以使用它的人必須為它所做的事負責。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"只不過"},{"w":"partially","pos":"adv.","def":"not completely; partly","cn":"部分地","s":"The new system is only ________ automated, so workers still need to check every order before it leaves.","zh":"新系統只有部分自動化,所以工人仍然需要在每筆訂單出貨前檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"部分"},{"w":"seldom","pos":"adv.","def":"not often; rarely","cn":"很少;不常","s":"The robot ________ makes mistakes, but when it does, they can be expensive, so humans still check its work.","zh":"這台機器人很少犯錯,但一旦犯錯就可能代價高昂,所以人類仍然會檢查它的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"很少"},{"w":"undoubtedly","pos":"adv.","def":"certainly; without any doubt","cn":"無疑地","s":"Robots will ________ change the way we work, but nobody knows exactly which jobs will disappear first.","zh":"機器人無疑會改變我們的工作方式,但沒有人確切知道哪些工作會最先消失。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"無疑"},{"w":"hitherto","pos":"adv.","def":"until now; until a particular time","cn":"迄今;到目前為止","s":"The robot reached places that had ________ been impossible to explore, and it sent back amazing pictures from the cave.","zh":"這台機器人抵達了迄今無法探索的地方,並從洞穴傳回了驚人的照片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"迄今"},{"w":"thus","pos":"adv.","def":"as a result; therefore","cn":"因此","s":"The robot works all night without breaks, and ________ the factory can produce far more goods each day.","zh":"機器人整夜工作不休息,因此工廠每天能生產多得多的商品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"因此"},{"w":"henceforth","pos":"adv.","def":"from this time on","cn":"從今以後","s":"The company announced that ________ all deliveries in the city centre would be made by robots, so drivers were moved to other areas.","zh":"公司宣布從今以後市中心的所有配送都將由機器人完成,所以司機被調到其他地區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"從今以後"},{"w":"roughly","pos":"adv.","def":"about; approximately","cn":"大約","s":"________ half of the jobs in the warehouse are now done by robots, but the company still employs about three hundred people.","zh":"倉庫裡大約一半的工作現在由機器人完成,但公司仍然僱用約三百人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"大約"},{"w":"swiftly","pos":"adv.","def":"quickly","cn":"迅速地","s":"The rescue robot moved ________ through the smoke, and it found the trapped family within minutes.","zh":"救援機器人在煙霧中迅速地移動,並在幾分鐘內找到了受困的一家人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"迅速地"},{"w":"wear and tear","pos":"n.phr.","def":"damage that happens through normal use over time","cn":"(正常使用造成的)磨損","s":"After five years of daily use, the robot showed signs of ______ ______ ______, so the company replaced its wheels and joints.","zh":"經過五年的每日使用,這台機器人出現了磨損的跡象,所以公司更換了它的輪子和關節。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"磨損"},{"w":"around the clock","pos":"phr.","def":"all day and all night without stopping","cn":"日以繼夜;全天候","s":"Robots in the warehouse work ______ ______ ______, so customers can receive their orders even on public holidays.","zh":"倉庫裡的機器人全天候工作,所以顧客即使在國定假日也能收到訂單。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"全天候"},{"w":"put to the test","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to check how good something is by using it in a hard situation","cn":"接受考驗;測試","s":"The rescue robot was ______ ______ ______ ______ after the earthquake, and it found three people under the broken building.","zh":"救援機器人在地震後接受了考驗,它在倒塌的建築下找到了三個人。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"接受了考驗"},{"w":"come into play","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start to have an effect","cn":"開始發揮作用","s":"Human judgement must ______ ______ ______ when the robot faces a new situation, because it only knows what it has learned.","zh":"當機器人面臨新情況時,人類的判斷力就必須開始發揮作用,因為它只知道它學過的東西。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"開始發揮作用"},{"w":"at the push of a button","pos":"phr.","def":"very easily, by just pressing a button","cn":"一按按鈕就;輕而易舉地","s":"You can start the robot vacuum ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, and it will clean the whole flat by itself.","zh":"你一按按鈕就能啟動掃地機器人,它會自己打掃整間公寓。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"一按按鈕就"},{"w":"phase in","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to introduce something gradually","cn":"逐步採用;分階段實施","s":"The city plans to ______ ______ robot buses over five years, so drivers will have time to train for new jobs.","zh":"市政府計畫在五年內逐步引進機器人公車,這樣司機就有時間接受新工作的訓練。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"逐步引進"},{"w":"step in","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become involved to help or stop a problem","cn":"介入;出面","s":"If the robot cannot answer a customer's question, a staff member will ______ ______ and help them right away.","zh":"如果機器人無法回答顧客的問題,員工會介入並立即協助他們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"介入"},{"w":"keep an eye on","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to watch something carefully","cn":"留意;看管","s":"A supervisor must ______ ______ ______ ______ the robots during the night shift, because a small problem can quickly become serious.","zh":"夜班期間必須有一位主管留意機器人,因為小問題很快就可能變得嚴重。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"留意"},{"w":"level the playing field","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make a situation fair for everyone","cn":"創造公平的競爭環境","s":"Video technology helps ______ ______ ______ ______ in sport, because every team gets the same fair decisions.","zh":"影像科技有助於在運動中創造公平的競爭環境,因為每支隊伍都得到同樣公正的判決。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"創造公平的競爭環境"},{"w":"the benefit of the doubt","pos":"n.phr.","def":"believing someone when you are not completely sure","cn":"(在不確定時)姑且相信","s":"Human umpires sometimes gave popular players ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but the robot treats everyone exactly the same.","zh":"人類裁判有時會對受歡迎的球員姑且相信,但機器人對每個人都一視同仁。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"姑且相信"},{"w":"call the shots","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be the person who makes the important decisions","cn":"發號施令;做主","s":"Robots may do the work, but humans still ______ ______ ______, so we decide what the machines should and should not do.","zh":"機器人也許負責做事,但人類仍然發號施令,所以由我們決定機器該做和不該做什麼。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"發號施令"},{"w":"at a standstill","pos":"phr.","def":"not moving or making any progress","cn":"陷入停頓;停滯","s":"The whole warehouse was ______ ______ ______ after the computer crashed, so hundreds of parcels were delivered late.","zh":"電腦當機後整個倉庫陷入停頓,所以數百個包裹延遲送達。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"陷入停頓"},{"w":"up and running","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"working properly after being set up or repaired","cn":"開始運作;正常運轉","s":"The technicians got the robots ______ ______ ______ again within an hour, so the factory lost very little time.","zh":"技術人員在一小時內就讓機器人重新正常運轉,所以工廠幾乎沒有損失時間。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"正常運轉"},{"w":"second nature","pos":"n.phr.","def":"something you do easily without thinking","cn":"第二天性;習以為常","s":"Using voice commands has become ______ ______ for my children, so they talk to the smart speaker like a friend.","zh":"使用語音指令對我的孩子們來說已經成為第二天性,所以他們像跟朋友一樣和智慧音箱說話。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"第二天性"},{"w":"move with the times","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to change your ideas or methods as the world changes","cn":"與時俱進","s":"Older shop owners must ______ ______ ______ ______, or they may lose customers to stores that use modern technology.","zh":"年長的店主必須與時俱進,否則他們可能會把顧客輸給使用現代科技的商店。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"與時俱進"},{"w":"pave the way for","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make it possible for something to happen later","cn":"為…鋪路","s":"Early factory robots helped ______ ______ ______ ______ today's home robots, because they proved that machines could work safely.","zh":"早期的工廠機器人幫忙為今日的家用機器人鋪路,因為它們證明了機器可以安全地工作。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"為 鋪路"},{"w":"here to stay","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"accepted and likely to continue for a long time","cn":"會一直存在;不會消失","s":"Some people still dislike robot waiters, but most experts agree that this technology is ______ ______ ______.","zh":"有些人仍然不喜歡機器人服務生,但大多數專家都同意這項技術會一直存在。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"會一直存在"},{"w":"by hand","pos":"phr.","def":"using your hands, not a machine","cn":"用手;手工","s":"My grandmother still washes her clothes ______ ______, although we bought her a washing machine last year.","zh":"我奶奶仍然用手洗衣服,雖然我們去年買了一台洗衣機給她。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"用手"},{"w":"a close call","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a situation where something bad almost happened","cn":"千鈞一髮;險些出事","s":"It was ______ ______ ______ when the robot arm nearly hit a worker, so the factory moved the safety line further back.","zh":"當機器手臂差點撞到一名工人時真是千鈞一髮,所以工廠把安全線往後移。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"千鈞一髮"},{"w":"on the line","pos":"phr.","def":"at risk of being lost or damaged","cn":"岌岌可危;面臨風險","s":"Thousands of jobs are ______ ______ ______ because of the new robots, so the union is meeting the company next week.","zh":"因為新機器人,數千個工作岌岌可危,所以工會下週將和公司會面。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"岌岌可危"}]};
